Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.15,0:00:36.66,Title,0,0,0,0,,《小鬼当家 真爱宝藏》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.04,0:00:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,看房开放日 待售 加文·华盛顿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.12,0:00:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,看房开放日 待售
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.04,0:01:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的厨房连着那边的一个小餐厅\NAnd our kitchen connects to a little dining room right over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.45,0:01:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,您说过您想要开放式的厨房\NNow you mentioned you wanted an open concept.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.66,0:01:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 我超喜欢开放式设计 是啊\NCool，I am obsessed with open concept。Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.83,0:01:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最爱的就是开放式设计\NOpen is my favorite concept.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.83,0:01:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这两位是房主 帕姆和杰夫·麦肯齐\NWell，here they are，Pam and Jeff McKenzie，the owners.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.87,0:01:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚跟布莱克金夫妇说 他们也许可以\NI was just telling the Breckins that they could probably knock down
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.95,0:01:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,打掉一些墙 打造一个开阔宽敞的空间\Nsome of these walls and make it one，big，open space.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.33,0:01:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万别生气噢 是啊\NNot mad at that。Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.37,0:01:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你们得当心了\NWell，you just wanna be careful，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.20,0:01:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为如果你们打的是承重墙\N'cause if those are loadbaring walls and you knock one down，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.08,0:01:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,整栋房子会坍塌的\Nthe whole place could collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.62,0:01:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗 好郁闷\NMmm。Bummer。Really？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.70,0:01:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这又不是积木叠的房子 杰夫\NUm，it's not a Jenga tower，Jeff.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.16,0:01:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是积木叠的房子 杰夫\NIt's not a Jenga tower，Jeff.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.37,0:01:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕姆是温内特卡小学的老师\NAnd Pam is a teacher at Winnetka Elementary.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.58,0:01:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吗 好的 附近的学校都超级棒\NAm I right？Yes。The schools here are amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.00,0:01:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吗 杰夫\NCorrect，Jeff？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.45,0:01:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 有好几所是州里的一流学校 它们真的棒棒的\NUm，yeah。Some of the best in the state。They are totally lit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.20,0:01:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃 哦\NAw。Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.45,0:01:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们配了新的金属探测器以后就更棒了\NEspecially since they put in new metal detectors.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.62,0:02:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 杰夫 你胡说什么\NOh。Okay。Jeff。What are you doing？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.75,0:02:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰夫 你可以去给大家拿瓶装水吗\NUh，Jeff，uh，could you go get some more bottled water to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.04,0:02:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以\NYep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.12,0:02:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以去多拿点瓶装水吗\NCan you get some more bottled water？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.87,0:02:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个 好的\NOoh。Mmhmm。Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.29,0:02:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就是那样\NJeff.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.37,0:02:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 我真的要尿尿 你怎么又要尿尿了\NMum，I really have to pee。I cannot believe you need to go again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.04,0:02:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了让你用咖啡馆的洗手间\NI told you to use the restroom in the coffee shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.12,0:02:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯图叔叔用过的厕所我可不敢上\NAfter Uncle Stu had been in there？Really？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.04,0:02:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到他在午餐时吃了多少芥末蘸蛋吗\NDid you see how many deviled eggs he had for lunch？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.20,0:02:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\NOh，goodness。Um.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.50,0:02:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你只能等我们到家再说了\NYou'll just have to wait till we get home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.50,0:02:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗 你想想\NYou sure about that？Do the maths.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.75,0:02:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个十岁小孩的小膀胱 装着六杯汽水可撑不了那么久\NSix soda refills into one，tiny，tenyearold's bladder does not go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.66,0:02:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\NI'm
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.41,0:02:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,看房开放日 加文·华盛顿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.50,0:02:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我有办法了 什么办法\NOkay。I've got an idea。What？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.32,0:02:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得配合妈妈演戏\NYou're gonna have to pretend with Mummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.32,0:02:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们假装我们要买房\NWe're gonna have to pretend we're going to buy a house.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.70,0:03:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,橘子 汽水 我可以喝一罐吗\NOoh！Can I get one of those？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.83,0:03:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这得问你的爸爸妈妈\NUh，that might be a question for your parents，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.83,0:03:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为它们的含糖量很高\Njust 'cause there's a lot of sugar in them，so…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.12,0:03:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\NOh。Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.75,0:03:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 你好高啊 你差不多和弗兰肯斯坦一样高了\NWow，you're so tall。You almost look like Frankenstein.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.91,0:03:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想说的是弗兰肯斯坦造的怪物吧 科普一下 弗兰肯斯坦是那个博士\NOh，you mean Frankenstein's monster。Frankenstein is the doctor，FYI.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.32,0:03:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些娃娃还真“酷”啊\NUh。Cool dolls.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.82,0:03:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我的娃娃 是我妈妈的\NWell，they're not mine。Um。They belonged to my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.37,0:03:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说是就是了\NSure they did.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.95,0:03:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个娃娃是怎么回事\NOh！What's wrong with this one？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.62,0:03:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\NYeah，I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.00,0:03:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但它们很易碎 我们就放着别动吧\NBut they're very delicate，so why don't we just leave them right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.16,0:03:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个小公举不想让别人玩他的洋娃娃呢\NOh。Little boy doesn't wanna share his dolly？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.16,0:03:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么\NExcuse me？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.37,0:03:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂了 你是那种人\NAh，I get it。You're one of those guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.91,0:03:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思 我不知道啊 要不然你告诉我？\NWhat do you mean？I don't know。You tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.50,0:03:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里啊 嗨 妈妈\NThere you are。Oh！Hi，Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.41,0:03:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得他像不像弗兰肯斯坦\NDoesn't he look like Frankenstein to you？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.12,0:03:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克斯 别胡说 非常抱歉\NIMax。I am so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.16,0:04:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不像弗兰肯斯坦 他像弗兰肯斯坦造的怪物\NNo，he doesn't look like Frankenstein。He looks like Frankenstein's monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.25,0:04:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉 他刚刚是不是一直在打扰你\NI'm sorry。Has he been bothering you？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.29,0:04:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 他很讨人喜欢\NNo。He's a delight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.00,0:04:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有时候确实很可爱\NAw，well，he has his moments.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.87,0:04:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是施耐德人仔吗\NOoh！Is that a Schneider Kinder？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.12,0:04:14.70,Title,0,0,0,0,,我在《藏宝箱》里看过 就是那个古董节目 我超爱看那个节目\NI saw these on Treasure Trunk，that antiques show。I love that show.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.70,0:04:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个老太太在一个车库旧货售卖会上 花十美元买了这样的娃娃\NThere was this elderly lady who'd bought one at a garage sale for about $10.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.07,0:04:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来那个娃娃竟然卖了五千美元\NAnd then it ended up going for about $5，000.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.20,0:04:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 一个丑丑的小瓷娃娃竟然值五千美元\NWow，5，000 bucks for an ugly，little porcelain kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.50,0:04:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我卖亲生的娃娃都赚不到一半的钱呢\NI didn't get half that for selling my real kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.33,0:04:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\NYeah？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.33,0:04:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得回去了 “好耶”\NI think we should go home。Oh，yay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.54,0:04:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,回家跟九个堂兄弟姐妹抢一个厕所 我好“迫不及待”啊\NI can't wait to go home and share one toilet with nine bloomin' cousins.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.45,0:04:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克斯韦·约翰·默瑟 你今天怎么回事\NMaxwell Johan Mercer。What is with you today，hmm？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.62,0:04:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡罗尔·埃伦·默瑟 你猜猜\NCarol Ellen Mercer，take a guess？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.45,0:04:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你顶嘴是吧 这次我们去东京过圣诞节不带你了\NYou know what？How's about we just spend Christmas in Tokyo without you？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.83,0:04:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 让奶奶陪你过节吧\NGreat idea。I'll leave Grammy with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.29,0:04:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 有奶奶陪\NOh，yes，Grammy。Then you'll have to go to bed
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.75,0:04:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你每天晚上都得六点钟就上床睡觉\Nat 6：00 p.m。every evening and help her with her bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.12,0:04:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,还得照顾她洗澡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.20,0:05:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么好啊 请问我该去哪里登记报名呢\NOh，that sounds great。Where do I sign up？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.45,0:05:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,回家的路上别想吃麦当劳了\NNo McDonald's for you on the way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.79,0:05:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 妈妈 你不能答应了让孩子吃麦当劳又食言\NWhat？Mum。You can't promise a kid McDonald's and not deliver。Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.87,0:05:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,真遗憾啊\NWhat a McShame.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.79,0:05:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好喝了\NOoh。That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.54,0:05:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 回家 上车 我们走\NDarling，home。Car。Now。Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.58,0:05:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我刚才冲你发脾气了 但我就是搞不懂\NI'm sorry I lashed out at you，but I just don't see why
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.50,0:05:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要让每个愚蠢的亲戚都住我们家\Nwe have to share our house with every stupid relative we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.70,0:05:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是圣诞节啊\NI mean，it's Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.54,0:05:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说到点子上了 圣诞节就是要跟家人一起庆祝\NExactly，and Christmas is all about spending time with family.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.75,0:05:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算他们的所作所为 让你焦虑 气愤和发狂也得一起庆祝\NEven if everything they do makes you anxious or furious and insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.62,0:06:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为那是圣诞节的意义所在\NBecause that is the meaning of Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.83,0:06:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 麦肯齐先生和夫人 我们已经抛出了鱼饵\NAll right，McKenzies。We have chummed the.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.66,0:06:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在已经有几条大鱼在咬鱼饵了\NChummed the waters。And I think we've gotten a couple of nibbles.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.95,0:06:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你们想尽快把房子卖出去\NNow I know you guys wanna sell as soon as possible，
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.41,0:06:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我觉得在圣诞季结束之前\Nbut I don't think we're gonna get any major bites
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.75,0:06:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,大鱼是不会上钩的\Nuntil after the holiday season.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.87,0:06:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会吧\NI don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.95,0:06:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰夫看到有个家伙仔细看了我的内衣抽屉 他看起来很感兴趣呀 不是吗\NThe guy Jeff saw looking through my underwear drawer seemed interested，no？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.45,0:06:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 不过他不是对买房感兴趣 不过别担心\NYes，but I don't think in buying the house。But don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.66,0:06:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱克金夫妇正围着鱼饵转呢 我会重点关注他们的\NThe Breckins are circling the boat，so I'll stay on top of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.75,0:06:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们回来了\NThe kids are home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.83,0:06:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道怎么⋯ 怎么了\NWhat's happening？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.95,0:06:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要怕孩子们\NWhy are we scared of the kids？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.33,0:06:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没跟他们说要卖房\NWe haven't told them we're selling the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.04,0:06:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\NHey！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.95,0:06:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\NOh，hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.45,0:06:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们 我以为你们看完电影后会给我们打电话\NHi，guys。I thought you were gonna call after the movie was over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.00,0:06:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是坐网约车回来的\NOh，no，we just took an Uber.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.54,0:06:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\NYou good？Oh，yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.54,0:07:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 我只是在想事情\NYeah，I'm doing some thinking，you know？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.83,0:07:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是个适合思考的好地方\NThis is a very good spot for thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.83,0:07:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 嗯\NMmhmm。Mmhmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.41,0:07:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢这个空间\NI love this space。Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.95,0:07:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\NWho are you？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.33,0:07:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是 这是加文 他是\NI'm，uh This is Gavin。And he is，um
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.66,0:07:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你的私人教练\NYour personal trainer。ThatYes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.25,0:07:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我要好好训一训 你们肌肉松弛的爸爸\NI'm gonna be training your flabby dad。Hmm？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.70,0:07:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那气球是怎么回事\NBalloons？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.12,0:07:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些气球是为了庆祝你迈出了第一步\NThese are a gesture to say congratulations for taking your first step.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.66,0:07:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜啦 老兄 你确实得好好锻炼了\NCongratulations，man。You got to take care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.04,0:07:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要跟肥肚腩说拜拜了 对吗\NWe're gonna get rid of that jelly belly，Dad。Am I right？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.54,0:07:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟肥肚腩说拜拜\NGet rid of the jelly belly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.87,0:07:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要让他的扁平臀练出肌肉来\NWe're gonna put some muscle on that flat，pancake butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.87,0:07:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了 加文\NThank you，Gavin。Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.20,0:07:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 那我就先走了 改天再见\NI'm just gonna take off real quick，and I'm gonna see y'all later.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.95,0:07:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经等不及看你练出翘臀了\NAnd I'm looking forward to that butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.83,0:07:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦卡利斯特 家居安保
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.40,0:07:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以玩一下吗 我就玩一下 你揍他啊\NCan I have a go？Can I have a go？You do it！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.65,0:07:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好差劲 今天的这个会议电话⋯\NPlease？No，you！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.40,0:08:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 就让我快快地玩一盘\NPlease，just one quick go。Ow！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.12,0:08:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克斯 你马上给我收拾这堆东西\NMax，clean up all this crap right now。Sorry，Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.70,0:08:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 爸爸 我竟然踩了乐高玩具\NI just stepped on a Lego.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.95,0:08:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界上最让人心痛的事\NIt's the most painful thing in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.20,0:08:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就要赢了\NI'm winning over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.66,0:08:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,低压系统⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.04,0:08:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我们的航班是取消后重新预订的\NI understand that our flight was canceled and rebooked.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.37,0:08:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,客户支持
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.45,0:08:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,暴风雪 预告
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.54,0:08:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我的问题是 你们把我的家人分到了两个航班上\NNo，my problem is that you have split our family onto two separate flights.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.66,0:08:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 你能大声点吗 这里很吵\NI'm sorry，can you speak up，please？It's very loud in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.91,0:08:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你抓不到我 笨蛋\NYou can never catch me。Jerk！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.50,0:08:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰我 变态 我是你姐姐\NDon't touch me，perv。I'm your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.58,0:08:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,居家小精灵 现在是日本的什么年\NHomebot，what year is it in Japan？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.08,0:08:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们 是谁总是把小精灵切换成德语的\NGuys，seriously，who keeps swapping the Homebot to German？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.65,0:08:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 小精灵 不对\NHey！Homebot，nein！Nein！Ha ha！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.54,0:08:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们 小精灵不是玩具\NGuys，Homebot is not a toy
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.29,0:08:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 停下来 住手 小精灵不是玩具\NNo，no，stop！Stop it！Homebot is not a toy！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.08,0:08:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真是受够了这些破事\NI'm sick of this bullsh
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.95,0:09:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,咕比 说脏话这种事 就不用跟圣诞老人打报告了 对吗\NWe don't have to tell Santa about that，right，Goobie？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.45,0:09:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说话的时候大声点\NYou need to project when you speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.41,0:09:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 我没有你大呼小叫 妈妈\NSir，I am not taking a tone with you。Mum.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.41,0:09:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是说 你把我的孩子安排到了另一个航班上\NI'm simply saying that you have put me on a different flight to my children.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.62,0:09:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 电脑不允许更改？\NMum。The computer won't let you？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.50,0:09:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,电脑算什么东西 它是上帝吗\NWhat is the computer？Is it God？Guys，guys
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.00,0:09:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 等着吧 看我不打你们的屁股\NMum。Mum！Guess what？Spanking's on the menu！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.75,0:09:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克斯 拜托 你以为家里就你一个人 什么都得围着你转吗\NMax，please！You are not the only person in this house，darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.66,0:09:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望家里就我一个人\NI wish I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.91,0:09:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们 别让我追着跑 我有腱炎\NBoys，don't make me run。I have tendinitis.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.95,0:09:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开 麦克斯\NMove，Max.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.33,0:09:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手放下来 美式披萨 快来\NLay down your arms！Americans，please！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.45,0:09:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是披萨 太好了 有多少个披萨\NPizza！Lovely。How many do you have？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.58,0:09:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,三个意大利辣香肠和三个菠萝披萨\NThree pepperonis and three pineapples.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.29,0:09:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就快吃吧 大家都爱吃菠萝披萨\NLet's just get Everybody loves pineapple.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.04,0:09:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还要收拾行李和洗衣服\NI've still gotta do some packing and some laundry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.33,0:09:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,大伙儿 吃披萨啦\NEverybody，pizza！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.20,0:09:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家快过来吃 快点 我们明天早上五点就得起床了\NCan you come and eat，please？Seriously。We're gonna be up at 5：00 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.91,0:09:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手\NStop，please！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.91,0:09:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,停 你们会弄断脖子的 看看你们的手提箱\NStop。You'll break your neck。And look at your suitcases.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.83,0:10:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝马
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.70,0:10:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,机场将出现大面积航班延误\NWe expect major，major delays at the airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.54,0:10:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,天气预警 预计将有更多降雪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.87,0:10:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道奥黑尔国际机场将会何时恢复正常\NWe don't know when O'Hare is gonna be able to get back…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.37,0:10:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今天怎么回事 为什么要提金属探测器\NWhat was that today？Metal detectors？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.62,0:10:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 学校确实配了嘛 抱歉 探测器难道不棒棒的吗\NWhat？They have them。I'm sorry。Is that not 「lit」？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.00,0:10:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们现在是想卖掉房子 杰夫\NOkay，we are trying to sell the house，Jeff.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.95,0:10:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你说了卖房是唯一的选择\NYou're the one who said it's our only option，
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.25,0:10:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我需要你的配合 好吗\Nso I need you on my team，okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.91,0:10:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\NI know。I know。I just
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.29,0:10:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,可今天真的要卖房了 我很不喜欢\NToday，it felt real，and I didn't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.66,0:10:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我喜欢吗\NYou think I do？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.20,0:10:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直以为我们会在这个房子里终老一生\NI always thought we'd get old and weird in this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.16,0:10:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我们算过了 光靠我的工资我们住不起这栋房子\NWe've done the math。We can't afford it on my salary alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.50,0:10:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 但我在IBM公司的面试中表现得很好\NYeah，but I crushed my interview with IBM.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.37,0:10:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,表现很好吗 表现很好！\NYou crushed it。Crushed it！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.75,0:11:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那已经是三个月之前的事了\NBut that was three months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.54,0:11:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,凡是有头脑的公司 都会需要优秀的数据迁移经理的 好吗\NAny company with a brain needs a good data migration manager，okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.95,0:11:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是绝对不会在无人监管的情况下\NI wouldn't trust an algorithm to port over a MySQL database
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.79,0:11:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠算法将MYSOL数据库 迁移到新的服务器上的\Nto a new server without any human oversight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.25,0:11:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不会 但你可能要过一段时间才能找到新工作\NMe neither。But it might take a while to find another job.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.37,0:11:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己也说过 数据迁移的热潮已经过了\NYou said it yourself。The data migration boom is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.87,0:11:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是云时代\NIt's the cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.45,0:11:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,云时代\NThe cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.95,0:11:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正我需要你的配合 好吗\NSo I need you to get on board，okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.16,0:11:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,高兴一点 这是我们在这里度过的最后一个圣诞节\NCome on。It's our last Christmas here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.25,0:11:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,努力享受节日欢乐吧\NLet's try to enjoy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.12,0:11:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,无限的欢乐\NTons of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.29,0:11:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉特
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.66,0:12:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 汉特\NHunter？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.75,0:12:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕姆莎啦啦啦啦 有惊喜 我们到你们家外面了\NHey，Pamalamadingdong！Guess what？We're outside！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.37,0:12:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,起床 饶舌皇后奎因·拉蒂法\NGet up。Queen Latifah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.08,0:12:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,起床 你弟弟到了\NGet up。Your brother's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.62,0:12:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\NGod.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.41,0:12:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\NDamn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.33,0:12:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 我好想念雪啊\NGosh，I miss the snow！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.91,0:12:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你怎么会 怎么会在这里吗\NHey。What are you doing Doing here？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.87,0:12:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们早早就乘飞机了 要避开暴雪浩劫嘛\NWe flew in early to get ahead of snowpocalypse or whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.83,0:12:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,暴雪天劫\NSnowmageddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.50,0:12:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,暴雪浩劫好一点\NSnowpocalypse is better.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.41,0:12:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 快来啊\NHey，babe。Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.75,0:12:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了 宝贝 那是谁\NComing，baby！Who's that？Aah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.83,0:12:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕啷个帕姆 来抱一个\NPamuel L。Jackson！Bring it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.41,0:12:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 汉特\NHi，Hunter。Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.66,0:12:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,她来啦\NHere she is！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.16,0:12:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心哦\NOh。Careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.12,0:13:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦\NOkay！Hey。Oh！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.37,0:13:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该先打电话的 但我们想着给你们惊喜比较好玩\NOh，we would've called，but we thought it would be fun to surprise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.95,0:13:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你们惊喜吗\NYeah。Are you surprised？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.37,0:13:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很“惊喜” 非常“惊喜”\NWe are surprised。We're very surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.12,0:13:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道 这里真美\NI know。It's so cute here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.33,0:13:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅婶婶 嗨\NAunt Mei！So quaintHi！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.75,0:13:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 我的宝贝\NHi，my adorables.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.83,0:13:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你们要明天才到\NI didn't think you were coming till tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.54,0:13:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经到咯\NI'm here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.62,0:13:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都以为她明天才到 结果她半夜就到了\NWe all thought she was coming tomorrow，but she's come in the dead of night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.95,0:13:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 奥利 看看是谁来了\NHey，Ollie，look who it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.83,0:13:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是大伯杰夫 嗨 小家伙\NIt's Uncle Jeff。Hey。Hey，buddy！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.33,0:13:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥利 看 是雪 好的\NOllie，look！Snow！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.95,0:13:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你 小家伙\NGood to see you，buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.25,0:13:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他都长这么大了\NHe has gotten so big.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.87,0:13:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好耶\NOkay！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.25,0:13:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 抱歉\NOh，my gosh，I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.91,0:13:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是最后一次了 我保证 好吗\NIt's the last one。It's the last one。I promise，okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.04,0:13:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再扔了\NThat's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.33,0:13:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能帮我把行李搬进去吗 我先把小家伙安顿好\NMind giving our luggage a tuggage？I wanna get that guy situated.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.33,0:13:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\NWow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.33,0:14:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我们这一年过得很滋润\NYeah，we had a great year.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.08,0:14:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,臂力真不错 小家伙\NOh，great arm，buddy！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.12,0:14:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥利 那不是玩具 我来捡\NOllie，that is not a toy。I'll get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.33,0:14:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在教他说西班牙语\NWe're teaching him Spanish！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.04,0:14:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么跟你说的 不能拿别人的东西\NWhat did I tell you about taking other people's stuff？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.50,0:14:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算让我们睡哪里 娱乐室的沙发床\NWhere do you have us set up？Oh，in the den on the pullout.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.62,0:14:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 娱乐室的沙发床 好的\NOkay。In the den on the pullout。Yeah，okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.37,0:14:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰夫·麦肯齐 数据迁移经理 简历浏览次数
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.95,0:14:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,易贝网
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.33,0:14:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 那位女士说的是真的\NWow，that lady wasn't kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.16,0:14:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\NWhat？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.20,0:14:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,施耐德人仔 上下颠倒的男孩 价格 二十万美元
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.50,0:14:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,罕见制作失误 仅制作十件 上一个售价 二十二万七千美元
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.29,0:14:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.16,0:15:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事 去哪儿了\NWhat Where is it？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.41,0:15:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个臭小子偷了我的洋娃娃 我妈妈的洋娃娃\NThat brat kid stole my doll。My mom's doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.20,0:15:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,该怎样找到这个孩子\NHow am I gonna find this kid？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.50,0:15:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克斯韦·约翰·默瑟\NMaxwell Johan Mercer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.29,0:15:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡罗尔·埃伦·默瑟\NCarol Ellen Mercer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.87,0:15:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,有办法了\NBingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.00,0:15:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,已到达目的地\NYou have arrived at your destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.45,0:15:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点上车\NGet in the car！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.25,0:15:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们得赶快上车 你们都不知道我们晚了多久\NYou need to get in a car now。We are so late。You have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.87,0:15:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,打中了 你干嘛要打我\NGotcha！What was that for？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.08,0:15:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在好想哭 不可以\NI legit might cry right now。Don't！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.58,0:15:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我带领啦啦队要用的 你这个白痴\NI need that for cheerleading，you cretin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.37,0:15:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,去它个三明治的\NSon of a sandwich！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.95,0:15:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上车\NGet in the car！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.29,0:16:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要赶不上飞机了 大伙儿 快点\NWe're gonna miss the flight，you guys。Come on！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.66,0:16:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 老兄\NUh，hi，my dude。Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.04,0:16:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡罗尔·默瑟在吗\NIs Carol Mercer home？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.70,0:16:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡罗尔乘早班飞机先走了 网约车是她约的\NNo，Carol took the early flight。She booked the cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.79,0:16:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以用车人写的是她 但这都是我们约的 我们得出发了\NThat's why they're in her name。These are our cars。We need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.25,0:16:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以麻烦你把行李搬到后备箱吗\NWill you be a mensch？Put that in the back for us，huh？Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.50,0:16:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝芬妮 现在是在网约车前自拍的时候吗\NBethany，is this a good time for a selfie in front of an Uber？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.54,0:16:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这叫“不分场合”\Nill judged.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.25,0:16:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得发给我 好了 大伙儿 快上车\NText that to me。Okay，guys，get in the car！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.29,0:16:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你们的行李都交给司机\NGive your stuff to the driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.58,0:16:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我赶不及逛免税店… 我不是司机\NIf I miss the dutyfree shop… I'm not the driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.66,0:16:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就剃了某人的头 我是说真的\N…I am going to shave somebody's head。That's real.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.37,0:16:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱克 你知不知道 在日本能买酒喝\NBlake，you do realize they sell alcohol in Japan？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.70,0:16:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好消息 斯图\NHey，big news，Stu.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.29,0:16:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,免税店里卖将近一米长的三角巧克力\NDutyfree shops sell threefoot Toblerones.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.62,0:16:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位兄弟 我把这个交给你了 请你一定要好好看管\NHey，buddy。I'm gonna give that to you and ask you to take real good care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.58,0:16:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面装着我的睡眠呼吸机\NIt's got my sleep apnea machine in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.58,0:16:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知不知道 卡尔罗的儿子麦克斯在不在家\NDo you know if Carol's son，Max，is home？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.33,0:16:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你没看到他的话 那他就是在去日本的路上了\NIf you don't see him，he's halfway to Tokyo by now。All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.25,0:16:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都上车了吗 要开车咯\NIs that everyone？The cars are leaving now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.08,0:16:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家一起来 说茄子\NEverybody，say cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.83,0:17:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕姆 你去哪里了 我们还要为老年人唱歌呢\NEverybody，wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.91,0:17:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我出来买牛奶了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.16,0:17:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,全脂牛奶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.91,0:17:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,住这儿的人 密码是什么\NSomebody that lives here，what's the code？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.16,0:17:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈妈 谢谢 瑞奇\NYour mamma！Thank you，Ricky！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.04,0:17:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,猜猜我要先剃谁的头\NGuess who's number one to get his head shaved？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.07,0:17:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是瑞奇 快说密码\NIt's Ricky！Code！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.29,0:17:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,1112 1112 太好了\NOne，one，one，two。One，one，one，two。Brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.50,0:17:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这密码太弱了\NThat's a bad code.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.36,0:17:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,防护已启动\NArmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.70,0:17:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞定 好了\NHere we go。All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.45,0:17:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 但我真的要跟卡罗尔谈谈\NI'm sorry，but I really do need to talk to Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.54,0:17:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 别担心 我会让卡罗尔在应用上给你五星好评的\NYes。Don't worry。I'll make sure that Carol gives you five stars in the app.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.62,0:17:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟信誉第一嘛\NReputation is everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.45,0:17:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 等等\NOh，hey，wait！Wait！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.70,0:17:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看什么看\NWhat the heck are you looking at？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.33,0:18:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我今天过得太糟糕了\NI'm sorry。I'm having a bad day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.58,0:18:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那里\NThere it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.25,0:18:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\NOh，my…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.37,0:18:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 是一只狗而已\NOkay，it's just a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.95,0:19:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我太荒唐了 我这是疯了\NI'm being ridiculous。I've gone insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.45,0:19:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是守法好公民 我要告诉帕姆\NI'm a good，normal man。I'm gonna talk to Pam.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.66,0:19:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕姆\NPam.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.75,0:19:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是来帮忙的邻居\NI'm just a neighbor helping.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.45,0:19:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我浇了他们的狗 不对 是浇了植物\NI water their dogsplants.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.70,0:19:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是卡罗尔的朋友 她的全名叫卡罗尔·埃伦·默瑟\NI'm a friend of Carol's。A friend of Carol Ellen Mercer is her name.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.37,0:19:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得打电话给帕姆\NI gotta call Pam.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.58,0:19:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯蒙特 护理及康复中心
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.29,0:19:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他人呢\NWhere is he？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.70,0:19:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道他在哪里\NI'm not sure where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.25,0:19:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好还好\NOh，great.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.54,0:19:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\NI'm sorry。Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.29,0:19:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来了 抱歉 你还好吗\NOh。Here we go。Sorry。Hi。Is everything okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.12,0:19:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 谢谢 你穿的是什么\NYeah，fine。Thank you。What are you wearing？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.37,0:19:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没时间换衣服了 你这样穿很搞笑\NI didn't have time to change。You look ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.45,0:19:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 圣诞节快乐 各位长辈\NThank you。Season's greetings，seniors.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.12,0:19:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉演唱延迟了 至于为什么延迟 大家都看到了\NI apologize for the delay，but we all saw the reason why.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.04,0:19:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,负责降D调的人 让这个世界都按他的时间转\NMy Dflat has decided that the world runs on his time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.62,0:19:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,事不宜迟 我们这就给大家呈现 “游手好铃”乐团的表演\NWithout further ado，I give you the Ne'erDoBells.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.12,0:20:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,手握铃铛\NHands on bells.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.00,0:20:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,举起铃铛\NRaise the bells.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.91,0:20:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,二 三 四\NTwo，three，four.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.12,0:20:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你收到我的语音邮件了吗 收到了\NSo did you get my voice mail？Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.83,0:20:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都是过去两个小时发生的事情吗\NAll of this happened in the last two hours？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.95,0:20:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 洋娃娃就在那栋房子里 我在他的夹克里看到了\NYeah，the doll is in that house。I saw it in his jacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.50,0:20:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么不跟我说 我以为我可以自己处理\NWhy didn't you tell me this？I thought I would handle it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.00,0:20:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的处理方式就是擅闯民宅吗\NAnd your way of handling it was breaking and entering？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.45,0:20:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是正常进入 我有钥匙\NJust entering。I had the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.83,0:20:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这依然是违法的 杰夫 像一个灯泡\NIt's still against the law，Jeff。Like a lightbulb.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.54,0:20:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 这真是太糟糕了\NOh，my gosh。This is so terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.37,0:20:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有其它的驯鹿
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.45,0:20:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我没有进去 警官\NBut that's why I didn't do it，Columbo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.12,0:20:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\NWell，good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.29,0:20:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像匹诺曹 匹诺曹\NLike Pinocchio。Pinocchio.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.29,0:20:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该怎么办 我们需要那个娃娃\NWhat are we gonna do now？We need that doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.00,0:20:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 让我想想\NI know we do，okay？Just let me think.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.12,0:20:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,加入它们任何的游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.50,0:20:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,像专制的霸王 对\NUh，like Monopoly！Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.12,0:20:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,唱晚了\NThat's too late。Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.33,0:20:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,唱得乱七八糟\NBoo。Sounds like garbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.62,0:20:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫尔曼 不能这样说哦 这是实话\NHerman，no。None of that。Well，it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.58,0:20:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们真差劲\NYou stink.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.83,0:20:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞老人过来说
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.54,0:20:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这么办\NHere's what we're gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.87,0:20:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们等他们度假回来\NWe will wait until they come back from vacation，
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.29,0:21:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去找他们 我把一切都告诉那个妈妈\Nand then I will go over there。I will tell the mom everything，
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.54,0:21:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们把娃娃要回来\Nand we'll get the doll back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.87,0:21:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要一起唱\NGet it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.95,0:21:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定我们应该等吗\NAre you sure we should wait？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.66,0:21:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 杰夫 我不想让我的丈夫在监狱里过圣诞节\NYes，Jeff。I don't want my husband spending Christmas in jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.04,0:21:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好耶 嘿\NYippee！Hey！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.20,0:21:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\NWow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.79,0:21:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 那房子里藏的是我们的未来 帕姆\NBut the Our future is in that house，Pam.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.25,0:21:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心吧 它在一栋空房子里能出什么事\NCome on。What could happen to it in an empty house？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.83,0:21:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的啦 玛莎\NIt's okay，Martha.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.16,0:21:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,别怪她 出错的是你\NDon't blame her。That's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.45,0:21:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\NSorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.66,0:21:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可耻 这可是我的人生大事\NShame on you。This is my life choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.20,0:21:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,人呢\NHello？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.79,0:21:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈？\NMum？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.25,0:21:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸？\NDad？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.66,0:21:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱克叔叔？\NUncle Blake？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.12,0:21:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯图叔叔？\NUncle Stu？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.91,0:22:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞奇迹降临了\NIt's a Christmas miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.33,0:22:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油啊 老兄\NOh，come on，mate！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.33,0:22:29.87,Title,0,0,0,0,,天啊 隐私！《凯蒂的日记》
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.58,0:22:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 互联网 让我看看你的邪恶吧\NAll right，Internet。Show me your worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.08,0:22:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,您的互联网访问受阻
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.45,0:22:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这招厉害 爸爸妈妈\NWell played，Mum and Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.20,0:23:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,温内特卡 圣诞集市
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.54,0:23:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕姆 那个娃娃值二十三万八千美元\NPam，that doll is worth $238，000，
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.20,0:23:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿回别人从我们家偷走的东西真的违法吗\Nand is it really a crime to steal something that was stolen from you？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.12,0:23:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 橄榄球员辛普森 第二次就是这么惹火上身的\NYes，that's what O.J。got in trouble for。The second time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.00,0:23:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我只是觉得 我知道你想挽救局面\NOkay，I just think Look，I know that you wanna save the day
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.83,0:23:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你对丢了工作感到很抱歉\Nbecause you feel bad about losing your job.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.12,0:23:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿回自己的东西有什么错\NWhat's wrong with that？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.70,0:24:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你告诉孩子 你因为犯了重罪而入狱\NThe fact that you will feel a lot worse telling your kids you're…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.62,0:24:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会感觉非常糟糕的\Nin jail for committing a felony.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.70,0:24:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那只算是轻罪 我查过了\NNo，it's a misdemeanor。Yeah，I looked it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.45,0:24:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是犯罪证据 你知道怎么清除搜索历史吗\NThat is evidence。Do you know how to clear your search history？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.29,0:24:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,会啊 我应该…\NYeah。I mean，well，I probably
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.66,0:24:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定能搞定的 听着\NII'm sure I could figure it out。Okay，listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.58,0:24:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们制定了计划 就按计划行事 好吗\NWe made a plan。Let's just stick to it，okay？\NMom，Dad，look at us。Hey！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.87,0:24:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 爸爸 看我们 嘿\NHey！You like 'em？Look at Ollie.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.04,0:24:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,喜欢吗 看奥利 他是小精灵\NHe's a little elf.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.25,0:24:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真聪明 我们把饰品给他 他就自己戴上了\NHe's so smart。We handed 'em to him。He put 'em right on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.08,0:24:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,真聪明\NOh，amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.12,0:24:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,给帕姆来一对驯鹿角\NUm，could I get some，uh，reindeer antlers for Pam
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.95,0:24:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,再给我哥哥来一副精灵眼镜\Nand a pair of the little elf glasses for my brother？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.62,0:24:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞老人屋
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.70,0:24:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥利 你要笑得灿烂点 好吗\NOllie，we need big smiles from you，okay？Look at Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.95,0:24:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,咧嘴笑 奥利 咧嘴大笑\NBig smiles，Ollie。Big smiles.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.91,0:24:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这小家伙一面对镜头就激动\NLittle guy comes alive in front of the camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.83,0:24:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 照片很可爱吧\NUm，okay，cute photo much？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.12,0:24:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 你们看看\NI mean，come on。Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.29,0:24:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看拍出的效果 多可爱的画面啊\NLook at what's happened there。It's an adorable image.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.95,0:24:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,很可爱 超级可爱\NIt's cute。It's super cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.41,0:24:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是特别的回忆\NIt's a special memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.00,0:24:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们在北极实行无纸化政策\NAnd since we are paperfree at the North Pole，
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.45,0:25:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可以使用这个密码\Nyou can actually use this code
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.91,0:25:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,在云端下载这些特别的回忆照\Nto download that special memory right from the cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.20,0:25:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你们现场连固态储存也没有吗\NWhSo，you're not even using solidstate storage onsite？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.75,0:25:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你在说什么\NI don't know what that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.54,0:25:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我来告诉你\NI'll tell you what it means.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.91,0:25:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们把虚拟化和备份 全部交给托管服务提供商来负责\NWhat it means is，you're entirely at the whim of a hosted service provider
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.62,0:25:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是很危险的\Nfor virtualization and backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.33,0:25:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 我不是技术行业人士\NSir，I'm not a woman in tech.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.79,0:25:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只制造美好回忆 这不是电子游戏\NI'm a woman in memories。You know，it's not a video game.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.91,0:25:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不在乎这个 我搞不明白\NShe doesn't care。I don't understand
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.41,0:25:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们为什么会对这么重要的事情不上心\Nwhy you'd be so cavalier with something this important.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.91,0:25:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛蒂娜服装\NWhat is this？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.04,0:25:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是新时尚 宝贝 我们换一下颜色\NNew fashion，honey。We gotta We gotta switch up these colors.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.20,0:25:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 看这条裙子多漂亮\NMom，look at how cute this is。So cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.50,0:25:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,真漂亮 我可以买吗\NCan I get it？Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.25,0:25:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 宝贝 很抱歉 这太贵了\NOh，honey，no。I'm sorry，that's way too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.58,0:25:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 我不能让你错过这条裙子\NOkay，no，no，no。I can't stand the thought of you not having that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.91,0:25:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,就当这是梅梅婶婶提前给你送的圣诞礼物\NConsider it an early Christmas present from Auntie MeiMei.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.95,0:25:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你穿起来一定很漂亮 来\NYou're gonna look so hot。Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.54,0:25:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅⋯ 你说真的吗\NMei。Are you kidding？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.41,0:25:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,买这件\NThis，please.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.45,0:25:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,加文（房产经纪人） 给我打电话 我有一些好消息\NA top for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.12,0:26:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你我要送你什么 斯内克斯\NI'll tell you what I am gonna give you，Snakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.00,0:26:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,数到十以后\NI'm gonna give you 'til the count of ten
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.37,0:26:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把你这个丑陋 懦弱 没用的浑蛋\Nto get your ugly，yellow，nogood keister…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.75,0:26:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是垃圾 送下我的飞船\NUgh，this is garbage。…off my spaceship…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.00,0:26:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,真搞不懂为什么他们总是要重拍经典\NI don't know why they're always trying to remake the classics.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.95,0:26:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,重拍的永远比不上原版\NNever as good as the originals.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.70,0:26:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,要吃爆哩个米花吗 克哩个斯\NYou want some more Pcorn，CTrain？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.37,0:26:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 那就太好了 好的\NOh，yeah，that'd be great。All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.33,0:26:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不记得家里有这个呀\NOne，two… I don't remember this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.00,0:26:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的房子差点就没了 帕姆莎啦啦啦啦\NNearly lost your house there，Pamalamadingdong.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.79,0:26:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 亲爱的\NHey，honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.16,0:26:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,把顶饰装上吧 我们一起好吗\NPut the topper on。Should we put it on together？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.41,0:26:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 一 二\NYeah。One，two，three.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.95,0:26:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞老人来过啦\NSanta came！Santa came！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.79,0:27:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞老人来过啦\NSanta came！Santa came！Santa came！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.50,0:27:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好高兴呀\NI'm so excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.95,0:27:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞老人来过啦\NSanta came！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.83,0:27:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 天啊 圣诞老人来过了\NOh，my God！Santa came.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.25,0:27:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,来抱抱 天啊\NCome here。Oh，my God！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.66,0:27:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,甜蜜的家\NHome sweet home.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.37,0:27:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 你一定要拯救我们的房子\NMom，you gotta save our house.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.45,0:27:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 妈妈 你可以把娃娃拿回来吗\NSeriously，Mom，will you just get the doll？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.45,0:27:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是正常入室 帕姆 我们有钥匙\NIt's just entering，Pam。We have the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.58,0:27:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕姆 快给我打电话\NPam，you have to call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.50,0:27:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 加文… 来把我带回去\NHi，Gavin… Come and get me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.08,0:27:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来 女士\NNow，Fräulein。Now！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.75,0:27:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的 你这丑丑的小男孩\NI will，you ugly，little boy！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.12,0:27:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用找零钱了 你这肮脏的俗人\NKeep the change，ya filthy earthling.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.16,0:27:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒是觉得你很帅气\NWell，I think you're very handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.83,0:27:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\NLet's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.12,0:27:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,去哪里 去买牛奶\NWhere are we going？To get some milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.41,0:27:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,冰箱里还有很多牛奶 帕姆\NOh，well，there's plenty of milk in the fridge，Pammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.16,0:27:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有很多牛奶 库存充足得很\NNo，you guys have a ton of milk。You're all set on milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.37,0:27:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,蛋酒 我们要去买些蛋酒\NUh，eggnog。We need We're gonna get some eggnog.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.75,0:27:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看过天气了吧 外面正上演着暴雪天劫\NYou've seen the weather，right？It's snowmageddon out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.45,0:27:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是暴雪浩劫 暴雪浩劫好一点\NYeah，snowpocalypse，babe。Snowpocalypse is better.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.58,0:27:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们能开车吗\NAre you gonna be okay to drive？Yes，yes，yes，yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.75,0:28:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,能开
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.16,0:28:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,能开 我们当然能开\NYes。We are okay to drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.66,0:28:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 你的直觉是对的\NHoney，your instincts were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.33,0:28:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能把发财的宝贝放在陌生人的家里\NWe can't leave a winning lottery ticket in some stranger's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.87,0:28:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我们这就去拿\NYeah，yeah。We are doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.70,0:28:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 那就是山毛榉街\NOh，honey，that's Beechtree.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.16,0:28:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 朝滑的方向打方向盘\NHoney，steer into the slide.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.00,0:28:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 应该说是朝打滑的方向打方向盘\NNNo，yyou steer into a skid.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.20,0:28:40.87,Title,0,0,0,0,,帕姆 我今天点播了一集《面对面》\NPam，I watched an episode of Locked Up earlier today on demand，
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.95,0:28:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能进监狱 帕姆\Nand… I can't go to jail，honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.70,0:28:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在普犯里绝对撑不了30秒\NI wouldn't last 30 seconds in gen pop.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.04,0:28:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么普犯\NGen pop？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.83,0:28:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,普通犯人 新囚犯会被抓起来打\NGeneral population。It's where fresh fish get got.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.37,0:28:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰夫\NJeff.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.91,0:29:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我打起精神来\NI need you to focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.08,0:29:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们谁也不会被抓起来打\NNobody here is getting got.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.75,0:29:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们唯一要抓的是那个瓷娃娃\NThe only thing getting got is that doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.41,0:29:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们就去抓\NSo let's go get it！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.16,0:29:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能解锁车门吗 好的 抱歉\NCan you unlock the door？Yeah。Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.00,0:29:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动\NDon't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.41,0:29:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么站着不动\NWhy are we standing still？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.79,0:29:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为灯光是动态感应式的 我们站着不动的话 它就会熄灭\NBecause the light is motionactivated，and if we stand still，it'll turn off.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.95,0:29:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但只要我们继续走动 灯就会再亮起来\NYeah，but it's just gonna turn back on when we move again.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.70,0:29:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们为什么要站着不动\NSo，why are we standing still now？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.08,0:29:48.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 我不擅长这个嘛\NI don't know。I'm not good at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.33,0:29:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\NI know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.08,0:30:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在是罪犯了 快进去\NAnd we're criminals.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.20,0:30:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,大门开启\NGo.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.41,0:30:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,警报\NAlarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.50,0:30:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好大声\NIt's loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.62,0:30:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,警报\NAlarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.00,0:30:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心 别滑倒\NBe careful。Don't slip.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.54,0:30:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,密码无效\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.87,0:30:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们离开得很匆忙\NThey did leave in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.50,0:30:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,警报启动
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.54,0:30:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪里看见小孩的夹克的 之前就在这里\NWhere'd you see the kid's jacket？It was right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.25,0:30:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们试过了\NWell，we tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.16,0:30:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,夹克又不会长脚 它一定在这里的某个地方\NA jacket can't just get up and walk away。It has to be here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.04,0:30:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要抛下我\NHey，don't bail on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.33,0:30:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是一个团队\NWe're a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.00,0:30:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\NOOkay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.83,0:30:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他？我就知道他有问题\NHim？I knew he was weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.87,0:30:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只需要找到那个丑小孩\NAll we have to do is find that ugly，little boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.66,0:30:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会有疯老婆子花二十万美元买它\NAnd then some crazy，old lady will pay us $200，000 for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.66,0:30:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,花二十万美元 就为了把它放在一个房间里\NTwohundred grand just to put him in a room，
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.70,0:30:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,用她的小刷子给它做清洁 然后跟她的朋友显摆炫耀\Nclean him off with her little brushes，and show him off to all her friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.20,0:31:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以喂他吃一块恶心的老太太糖吗\NMay I feed him a piece of this gross，old lady candy？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.25,0:31:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 他就吃这个\NOf course。That's all he eats.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.08,0:31:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,格特鲁德 他真好玩\NOh，Gertrude。He's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.83,0:31:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这钱花得值\NWorth every penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.29,0:31:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,花五千买一个丑丑的瓷娃娃\NFive grand for an ugly，porcelain kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.33,0:31:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我亲生的娃娃都卖不到一半的价格呢\NI didn't get half that for my real kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.00,0:31:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,找不到它我们就不走\NWe're not leaving here without him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.45,0:31:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不答应\NI don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.62,0:31:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那件外套\NThe jacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.87,0:31:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,小精灵 报警\NHomebot，call the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.04,0:31:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在家\NThere's someone home.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.87,0:31:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且还是德国人\NAnd she's German.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.95,0:32:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 数到三 我们撤 一\NOkay，on three，we run。One.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.83,0:32:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也太快了\NWhoa，that was fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.12,0:32:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,温内特卡警察 温内特卡村
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.62,0:32:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦卡利斯特
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.37,0:32:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好\NEvening.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.54,0:32:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\NHi.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.04,0:32:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,您好 警官\NHello，Officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.95,0:32:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你滑倒了吗\NDid somebody slip and fall？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.33,0:32:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,要被抓了吧\NHa！Busted.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.50,0:32:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你们的住处吗\NIs this your residence？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.16,0:32:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我们的还能是谁的\NWell，I certainly hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.16,0:32:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不然我过去14年 不是白白帮别人清理污水坑了吗\NOtherwise，I've been cleaning somebody else's sinks for the past 14 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.08,0:32:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,污水坑\NSinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.41,0:32:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么问题吗 警官\NIs there a problem，Officer？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.20,0:32:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 你先去发动汽车吧\NHoney，why don't you go warm up the car？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.95,0:33:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们接到电话 你们的警报启动了\NWe got a call。Your home alarm's been triggered.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.04,0:33:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 密码是我们的纪念日\NYeah，well，the code is our anniversary，so…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.00,0:33:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,您觉得他会记得吗\Nyou think he's gonna remember that？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.45,0:33:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,您肯定不会忘记你们的纪念日 对吧 警官\NI'm sure you never forget your anniversary，do you，Officer？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.95,0:33:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\NOh，no，no.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.87,0:33:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的无名指上还没戴戒指呢 夫人\NNo ring on this finger，ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.87,0:33:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没人能驯服我这狂野的公马\NNo one's been able to tame this wild stallion.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.45,0:33:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,真羡慕最后能拿下您的小母马\NWell，I envy the filly who eventually ropes you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.50,0:33:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,在别的时间 别的地点\NAnother time，another place.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.00,0:33:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,有着很多可能性 警官\NA whole lot of whatifs，Officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.91,0:33:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 很抱歉浪费了您的时间\NAnyway，I'm so sorry we wasted your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.37,0:33:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚还有什么需要我配合的吗\NIs there anything else I can help you with tonight？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.62,0:33:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 不用担心这个\NNo，don't worry 'bout it。No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.12,0:33:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你需要我 以忘记纪念日的名义逮捕你的丈夫\NUnless you want me to arrest your husband for missing your anniversary，huh？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.95,0:33:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我说“我确实想这样做”是不是很坏\NIs it bad if a part of me says，「Yeah，I do want that」？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.29,0:33:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么这么好笑\NWhat's so funny？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.33,0:34:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,要抓他吗\NGet it？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.50,0:34:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在等什么 逮捕他们啊\NWhat are you waiting for？Detain them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.91,0:34:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那… 逮捕他们\NNow Detain them！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.75,0:34:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么声音\NWhat was that？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.75,0:34:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 没问题\NNah，nah，we're all good.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.37,0:34:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你和你丈夫节日愉快\NWhat say you and your hubby have a nice holiday.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.50,0:34:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安\NAnd a good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.58,0:34:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你竟然把他们放走了\NWait，you're letting them get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.00,0:34:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后那两个人闯进我家\NAndAnd then those people broke into my house，
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.58,0:34:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他们是要绑架我或者…\Nand III Whoa，whoa.\N…think they're trying to kidnap me or Whoa，whoa，whoa，whoa，whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.44,0:34:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说你父母把你单独留在家？\NAre you saying your parents left you home alone？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.87,0:34:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,单独留在家？\NAlone？Alone？Alone？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.75,0:34:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要告诉别人 麦克斯\NWhy did you have to tell anyone，Max？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.29,0:34:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要这么大嘴巴\NWhy did you have to open your big mouth？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.50,0:35:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许报警不是个好主意\NMaybe the police is a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.29,0:35:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错的夫妇\NNice couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.87,0:35:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗\NYou know what？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.66,0:35:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,独自在家也许也没那么美妙 小精灵\NThis whole housetomyself thing might not have been the best idea，Homebot.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.66,0:35:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要怎么切换回英语\NHow do you switch back to English？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.79,0:35:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,将语言更换为英语\NChanging language to English.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.29,0:35:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来这么简单啊\NOh，that was easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.04,0:35:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,小精灵 呼叫妈妈\NHomebot，call Mum.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.08,0:35:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉 这款小精灵设备没有语言呼叫功能\NI'm sorry。Voice calling is not available on this Homebot device.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.70,0:35:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我该怎么办 小精灵\NSo what do I do，Homebot？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.41,0:35:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我联系不上妈妈 如果我告诉警察或其他人\NI can't call my mum，and if I tell the police or anyone else，
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.58,0:35:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会让我爸妈进监狱的\Nthey'll put my parents in jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.58,0:35:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓝鲸的血管很大 可以让成人在里面游泳同行\NA blue whale's veins are big enough for an adult human to swim through.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.12,0:35:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说这个有什么用\NHow is that supposed to help？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.58,0:35:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是东京的几点钟\NWhat time is it in Tokyo？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.00,0:35:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是日本东京第二天早上的11点37分\NIt is 11：37 a.m。tomorrow in Tokyo，Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.58,0:35:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 小精灵\NNight，Homebot.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.58,0:35:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 麦克斯\NGood night，Max.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.16,0:35:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么\NWhat？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.87,0:36:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,东京皇宫酒店\NWhaAre youAre you serious？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.95,0:36:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有搞错 你就没想过跟我核实吗\NSo at no point you thought to check with me？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.12,0:36:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想当然地认为麦克斯在另一趟航班上？\NYou just assumed that Max was on the other flight？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.45,0:36:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有点人数 我…\NWe didn't take a census。I
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.70,0:36:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯图 是你猜麦克斯在另一趟航班上的吗\NStu，did you assume he was on the plane？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.95,0:36:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡罗尔 我发誓 我们出发时他不在家里\NCarol，I swear to you。That boy was not in the house when we left.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.29,0:36:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你觉得他当时在哪儿 斯图 在该死的四季酒店里吗\NAnd where do you think he was，Stu？At theAt the Four freaking Seasons？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.29,0:36:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在飞机上吃了咖喱鱼\NHe had fish curry on the plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.75,0:36:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们估计得等30分钟才能看到他\NWe probably got a hard 30 before we're gonna see Stu.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.08,0:36:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知不知道 就因为你 我在日本\NYou do realize that，because of you，I'm in Japan，
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.62,0:36:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我十岁的儿子却单独留在家\Nand my tentenyearold son is at home by himself？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.91,0:36:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 但这也不是什么大错吧\NYeah，butbut firstworld problems，you know？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.91,0:36:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是什么大错？ 别打\NFirstworld problems？Stop it。Listen，listen，stop it！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.75,0:36:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我在品牌店买的\NI got that at Brookstone.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.87,0:36:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸还有五分钟就回来\NDad's five minutes away.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.08,0:36:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在旅行服务台那边 只能买到一张回家的票\NHe's at the travel desk and could only get one ticket home.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.00,0:36:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 您好 山毛榉街道\NYes，hello。Beechtree Lane.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.62,0:36:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,木字旁加举手的举 您可以立刻派一名警察过去吗\NWith two Beech with two E's。Can you send an officer right away？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.54,0:36:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人给家里打电话了吗\NDid somebody call the house？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.37,0:36:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 因为家里没装固定电话 现在没人用固定电话\NNo，because we don't have a landline。Nobody has a landline anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.75,0:36:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 斯图 没人用固定电话了 因为现在不是1993年\NYes，Stu，nobody has a landline anymore because it's not 1993.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.41,0:37:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有什么新点子 我是不是应该 听着八九十年代的歌曲 用寻呼机联系他\NWhat's your next idea？Should I beep him after I listen to the new MC Hammer joint？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.16,0:37:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,邻居呢 联系邻居怎么样\NWhat about the neighbors？Call one of the neighbors.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.25,0:37:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,让祷告团开始为他的平安祷告吧 我们不认识邻居 布莱克\NActivate the prayer chain。We don't know the neighbors，Blake.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.12,0:37:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们才搬进去两个月 我连他们叫什么都不知道\NWe only moved there two months ago。I don't think we even know their names.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.33,0:37:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们认识的人都在伦敦\NEverybody we know is back in London.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.08,0:37:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 你要去哪里\NWell，Mum，where are you going？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.58,0:37:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去机场 我儿子还在家里 我不能坐着干等\NI'm going to go to the airport，darling，because I can't sit here while my son is
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.70,0:37:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的…我的护照呢\NI meanGod，where is my passport？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.70,0:37:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在你手上 在我手上\NIt's in your hand。It's in my hand。It's in my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.45,0:37:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,看吧 卡罗尔 别焦虑 别人犯了错我们要大方原谅\NSee，Carol？Under stress，people make mistakes that we should forgive.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.20,0:37:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如忘了带护照 比如忘了带孩子\NYou know？People forget passports。People forget
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.87,0:37:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 别扔\NNo！Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.87,0:37:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 圣诞节快乐 妈妈非常爱你 好吗\NOh，darling，happy Christmas。Mummy loves you very much。Okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.04,0:37:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是什么情况 卡罗尔走了吗\NUh，what's happening？Did Carol leave？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.00,0:37:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,一路平安\NTravel safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.20,0:37:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是什么情况\NWhatWhat's going on？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.83,0:37:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,18号车 你在林肯海茨街区附近吗\NCar 18，car 18。You near Lincoln Heights？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.66,0:37:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们接到一通电话 有一个叫麦克斯韦·默瑟的小孩\NWe got a call about a minor，one Maxwell Mercer.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.58,0:37:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的父母去度假 可能把他遗忘在家里了\NParents are on vacation and think he might have been left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.62,0:37:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,地址是山毛榉街道36号 你开玩笑吧\NAddress is 36 Beechtree Lane。Oh，you gotta be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.41,0:38:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.91,0:38:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用管了 这是个恶搞电话 完毕\NYou can ignore that。That is a prank call。Over.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.83,0:38:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶搞电话？ 对\NPrank call？Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.45,0:38:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我小的时候 我们一家去度假\NListen，when I was a kid，my family went on vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.33,0:38:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们把我弟弟凯文遗忘在家里了\NWe forgot my little brother Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.54,0:38:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且是两次\NTwice.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.20,0:38:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他现在会打这种电话捉弄我 那个白痴每年都这么做\NHe called in the 289 to mess with me。The idiot does it every year.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.20,0:38:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗\NAre，uh，you sure about that？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.16,0:38:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确定得不得了\NYes，I'm sure about that！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.66,0:38:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确定那个地址没有小孩被遗忘在家里\NI know for a fact that there is no forgotten child at that address.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.41,0:38:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚 因为一个假的家居警报去过一趟 好吗\NI was just there for a bogus homealarm call，okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.12,0:38:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 那家装了麦卡利斯特家居安保系统\NGuess what？The place had a McCallister Home Alarm system.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.00,0:38:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,有这么巧的事情吗 我可不认为\NOh，gee，a coincidence？I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.95,0:38:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你可以顺便开过去看看吗\NYeah。So can you just drive by and check it out？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.08,0:39:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我这就过去\NTenfour。I'm on my way now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.29,0:39:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这招够狠啊 凯文\NNice try，Kevin。Nice try.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.37,0:39:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,讨厌鬼\NTrout sniffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.87,0:39:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好\NHey，guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.04,0:39:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们给你们留了位置 因为你们来晚了\NHey。We saved you some seats 'cause you were running late.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.70,0:39:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有人陆续过来呢 嗨\NPeople are still coming in。Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.62,0:39:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们给你留了位置 因为你来教堂晚了\NHey，we saved you a seat 'cause you were running late to church.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.37,0:39:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 谢谢\NYep。Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.45,0:39:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我下载了一款应用 它可以提醒你的助理\NI've got an app that will ping your assistant，
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.29,0:39:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你的助理通知你 你要迟到了 我发给你\Nlet you know when you're running late。I'll send it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.41,0:39:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好的 谢谢\NGreat。Okay。Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.29,0:39:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 那条裙子是不是有点那个\NHey，so that dress is really…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.29,0:39:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的肩膀露得也太多了\NHer shoulder is so bare。You see the full
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.91,0:39:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个肩膀都露出来了\NYou see her full shoulder。Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.91,0:39:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子长得真快啊 对吧 加文 你怎么也来了\NThey grow up so fast，don't they？Oh，Gavin。What are you doing here？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.33,0:39:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是圣诞前夕嘛 所以大家都往教堂跑\NWell，it's Christmas Eve。It's the day that everybody goes to church.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.83,0:40:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧 对\NAm I right？Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.91,0:40:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿您平安 是这么说的吗\NPeace be unto you。Peace be unto you。Is that how you say it？Peace be unto
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.08,0:40:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,真棒啊\NOh，this is nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.16,0:40:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣托马斯 天主教堂
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.08,0:40:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,教堂玩具募捐 儿童玩具 入内捐赠
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.91,0:40:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都在躲着我 这是怎么回事\NYou dudes have been ghosting me。What up with that？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.83,0:40:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我们只是… 我有消息了\NNo，we're But I've got some news.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.83,0:40:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,“指挥中心” 有人报价了\NHouston，we have an offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.91,0:40:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\NWhat？Um.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.54,0:40:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人报价给你爸爸做私人训练\NUm，it's an offer for your dad's，uh，personal training.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.54,0:40:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经付了减肚腩的钱\NAnd since you already paid for that jelly belly，
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.54,0:40:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我再给你加腹肌和大腿的训练 我们说的是这个\NI'm gonna throw in some abs and thighs。That's what that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.50,0:40:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 很好\NThank you。Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.29,0:40:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里斯 你把玩具拿到募捐区好吗\NHey，Chris，honey，why don't you go put that，uh，toy in the toydrive area.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.29,0:40:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为你感到骄傲 真的\NYeah，we're so proud of you。We really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.29,0:41:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,把礼物送给有需要的孩子 我就是有需要的孩子 我需要这个\NWell，I'm definitely a child in need。Need of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.91,0:41:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要帮助的吗 噢 需要\NCan I help you？Oh，yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.37,0:41:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以给我推一辆购物车过来吗\NCan I get a shopping cart，please？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.00,0:41:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,购物车？\NMmm？Shopping cart.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.70,0:41:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 宝贝\NNo，sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.08,0:41:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些玩具是送给没你这么幸运的孩子的\NThese toys are for children less fortunate than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.45,0:41:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我就说哪有这种好事\NAh，okay。Thought it was too good to be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.04,0:41:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好酷\NWhoa，cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.12,0:41:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 小绅士\NThank you，young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.79,0:41:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你们都有个快乐的圣诞节\NAnd I hope you both have a very，very happy Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.87,0:41:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是不可能的了 为什么 怎么了 是父母出问题了吗\NThat's unlikely。Why？What's wrong？Parent trouble？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.54,0:41:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.79,0:41:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我说说\NTell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.20,0:41:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们以为我不知道他们有压力\NThey think I don't notice that they're stressed，
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.41,0:41:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们太明显了\Nbut it's super obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.04,0:41:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个怪怪的人总是冒出来 假装他是私人教练\NSome weird guy keeps showing up pretending to be a personal trainer.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.91,0:41:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样 你们有什么想法\NSo？What do you say？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.00,0:41:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁出的价 布莱克金夫妇\NWhatWhoWho made this offer？Oh，the Breckins.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.45,0:41:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得从市里来的那对年轻夫妇吗\NRemember the young couple from the city？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.54,0:41:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想在新年前签好合同\NYeah，so they need to sign the contract before the new year.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.62,0:41:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,以便应对税的问题\NSomething about a tax thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.62,0:41:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能 这不可能\NWe can't do that。That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.87,0:41:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们还真有钱 对吧 我们才是最穷的\NYeah，rich people。Am I right？We're the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.95,0:42:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但听着 除这个以外不会有更高的报价了\NBut listen，we're not gonna get a better offer than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.91,0:42:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你们趁着过节好好想想 然后回复我\NSo，why don't you take the holiday，think it over and get back to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.41,0:42:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗 不要有压力 好吧 还是有点压力的\NAll right？No presh。Well，maybe a little presh.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.83,0:42:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 其实压力很大\NAll right，you know，it's a lot of presh，actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.08,0:42:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 圣诞节快乐\NAll right，cool。Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.18,0:42:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以给你们发一下名片吗\NYou know what？Can I give you a couple of my business cards？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.75,0:42:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫加文·华盛顿 我是房产经纪人\NYeah。Gavin Washington。I do real estate.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.95,0:42:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少你爸爸妈妈都在你身边\NAt least you're with your mum and dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.08,0:42:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸妈妈去了东京 我完全是一个人\NMine have gone to Tokyo。I'm totally on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.29,0:42:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也太酷了吧\NThat's the coolest thing ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.91,0:42:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来也以为很酷 但也只酷了一个小时\NI thought it would be，and for about an hour，it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.00,0:42:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我好孤独\NBut now I'm just lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.45,0:42:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 送给你\NHere。Have this.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.70,0:42:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来你和其它的孩子一样需要它\NSounds like you deserve it as much as anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.20,0:42:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞节快乐 你也是\NMerry Christmas。You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.41,0:42:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,和家人开心地过圣诞节吧 这才是圣诞节的特殊魅力\NEnjoy it with your family。That's what makes it special.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.54,0:42:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这小子真好\NNice kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.16,0:42:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 你真是善良的小男孩\NThank you。You're a kind little boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.12,0:42:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你今年想要什么 圣诞老人一定会让你心想事成的\NI think that Santa's gonna bring you everything you want this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.95,0:43:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就太好了 不过说真的\NThat'd be nice，but to be honest，
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.08,0:43:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想要我的爸爸妈妈回来\Nall I really want is my mum and dad back.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.29,0:43:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 你的爸爸妈妈都“走”了吗\NOh，dear。Well，when did you lose them？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.91,0:43:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,两天前走的\NUm，two days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.95,0:43:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,竟然是在圣诞期间“走”的 可怜的孩子\NOh。Right at Christmas？You poor little thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.83,0:43:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么谁来照顾你\NBut who's taking care of you？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.79,0:43:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,家里就只有我和咕比 不过我们撑过来了\NUh，it's just me and Goobie at home，but we're getting by all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.41,0:43:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我因锡安必不静默\NFor Zion's sake，I will not keep silent…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.33,0:43:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕姆 是那个孩子\NPam。Pam，it's the kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.62,0:43:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 是他 那个老太太是谁\NYou're right。It is。Who's the old lady？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.62,0:43:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的救赎⋯ 看房日那天 那孩子的妈妈说\NOh，at the open house，the kid's mom said
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.50,0:43:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会把孩子留下来跟他奶奶一起过\Nshe was gonna leave the kid behind with the grandmother.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.62,0:43:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想到她会真的这么干\NI can't believe she went through with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.66,0:43:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以那个说德语的是他奶奶\NSo grandma's the German.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.83,0:43:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,说德语的是他奶奶\NGrandma's the German.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.25,0:43:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 现在有什么计划\NAll right。So what's the plan？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.83,0:43:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,时机完美 我们趁他们不在家时把瓷娃娃要回来\NIt's perfect。We go now while they're not home and get our doll back.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.79,0:43:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,老太太开车慢 我们在他们出停车场之前进屋拿东西离开\NThe way old ladies drive，we'll be in and out before they leave the parking lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.66,0:43:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,减速
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.04,0:44:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 我得经常来教堂了\NWow，I need to come to church more often.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.83,0:44:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在街上人太多了\NThe street's too hot right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.62,0:44:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们等到天黑再动手\NWe'll wait till it gets dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.08,0:44:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们待会儿再回来\NWe'll go around back.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.12,0:44:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命 帕姆警官\NOkay，Axel Foley.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.75,0:44:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,候补\NStandby…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.54,0:44:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,候补\NStandby.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.75,0:44:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 刚刚她是说了“候补”吗\NSorry，did you just hear standstandby？Huh？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.37,0:44:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 借过一下 抱歉\NSorry，sorry，sorry。Excuse me，excuse me，excuse me。Sorry，sorry，sorry，sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.91,0:44:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.79,0:44:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 你好\NSorry，uh，sorry。Uh，konnichiwa.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.62,0:45:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,请问你们什么时候\NWhen will the the standthe standby seats，
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.87,0:45:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,宣布候补席位 什么时候\Num，be announced？When？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.50,0:45:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,宣布\NAAnnounced？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.50,0:45:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士 我非常乐意为您效劳 但请您先排队\NMa'am，I'd be more than happy to help you after you stand in the line behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.37,0:45:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 节日快乐\NThank you，and happy season.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.25,0:45:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我急着回家陪我的儿子\NI am trying to get home to my son，
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.16,0:45:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他独自一人 担惊受怕 他需要妈妈\Nwho's alone and scared，and he needs his mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.33,0:45:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我要你现在就回答我的问题\NSo I need you to answer my question right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.95,0:45:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,候补席位将会在登记窗口关闭后宣布\NStandby seat assignments will be announced after the checkin window closes
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.25,0:45:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概在起飞前的一小时\Napproximately one hour before departure.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.79,0:45:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\NThank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.95,0:45:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 抱歉\NAnd sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.83,0:45:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\NAnd sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.95,0:45:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不客气 感谢选择我们的航班\NOh，not a problem。Thank you for flying with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.58,0:45:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,您好\NHi.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.20,0:45:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,要动手了吗\NSo we're doing this？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.50,0:45:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 表现自然点\NYeah，just act casual.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.41,0:45:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,就假装是在散步 对\NJust going for a walk。Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.91,0:45:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只不过是在晚上 散步到了别人家的后院\NIt's just a stroll through people's backyards aat night.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.20,0:45:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,还散步到了灌木丛里\NThrough some undergrowth.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.20,0:46:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是世界上最正常不过的事情了 对\NIt's the most natural thing in the world。Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.12,0:46:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道要怎么走吗\NDo you know where you're going？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.00,0:46:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道 跟我来\NYes。Now follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.00,0:46:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将在耶和华的手中成为华冠\N…you shall be a crown of beauty in the hands of the Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.29,0:46:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们去哪里了\NHey，where are they？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.37,0:46:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,“忘记预热烤炉了 很快就回来”\N「Forgot to preheat the oven。Be back soon.」
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.29,0:46:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这需要两个人回去吗\NThat's a twoperson job？I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.20,0:46:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 要开始了\NShh。Oh，look。It's starting.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.50,0:46:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始了\NOh，here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.91,0:46:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,快看艾比 她真漂亮\NOh，look at Abby。She looks so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.45,0:46:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 神圣的夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.75,0:46:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,星星在明亮地闪耀
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.37,0:46:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.29,0:46:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样\NThis is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.37,0:46:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是亲爱的救世主的诞生之夜
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.75,0:46:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这院墙怎么砌得这么高\NWhy's the wall so high？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.62,0:46:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们当这里是白金汉宫吗\NIt's not like it's Buckingham Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.41,0:46:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我们这样\NOkay。Here's what we'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.41,0:46:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把你抬上去 你上去后再拉我一把\NI'm gonna boost you up，and then when you get to the top，you'll lift me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.70,0:46:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以做到吗 可以\NDo you think you can do that？Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.83,0:46:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.75,0:46:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\NOkay，okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.83,0:46:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 准备好了吗\NOkay。Ready？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.91,0:46:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.54,0:47:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,屈膝跪下
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.83,0:47:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,聆听天使的声音\NJust Whoa！Just Ow！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.33,0:47:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 你就…\NOkay。Just
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.41,0:47:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二\NOne，two.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.29,0:47:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 抱歉\NOh，my God。I'm sorry。I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.20,0:47:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\NI'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.04,0:47:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,快爬上去\NJust get up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.58,0:47:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 三\NOkay。Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.83,0:47:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拉着我爬上来 好\NNow climb up me。Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.16,0:47:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,基督就是上主
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.95,0:47:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住我的手\NTake my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.41,0:47:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.79,0:47:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,上去\NGet up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.87,0:48:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,和光辉
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.87,0:48:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们永远歌颂
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.66,0:48:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.45,0:48:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我快上来了\NI'm nearly up.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.54,0:48:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.75,0:48:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,和光辉
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.70,0:48:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们永远歌颂
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.54,0:48:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 帕姆 我…\NIt's okay，Pam。I
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.50,0:48:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,有门\NOh.\NA gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.83,0:48:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里竟然有侧门\NA side gate？Really？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.75,0:48:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 但你不是也没看见侧门嘛\NI'm sorry，but it's not like you saw the gate either.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.41,0:48:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 我很好 谢谢\NOh，I'mI'm fine by the way。Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.83,0:48:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\NCome on.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.50,0:48:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\NWhat？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.75,0:49:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们的女儿\NThat's our little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.54,0:49:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,试着开门 好的\NTry the door。Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.04,0:49:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,“区别在于 衣服是为你量身定做的”\N「…the difference being that the clothes are made to fit you，
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.25,0:49:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,“但你必须为树而定制”\Nwhile you have to be made to fit the tree.「
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.00,0:49:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好不要让你爸爸听到你这么说\NBetter not let your father hear you say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.83,0:49:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\NOkay，Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.33,0:49:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,“想要用他们的水桶”\N「…wanted to with their buckets.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.20,0:49:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,“他们多么热切地爱着…”\NAnd how ardently they grew to love their…「
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.83,0:49:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,走错房子了 怪我 我也以为是那里\NThe wrong house。That's on me。Yeah，yeah。I get the sense it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.50,0:49:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去下一家\NOkay，let's just go next door.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.04,0:49:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他肯定在那家 我们去看看\NThat's where he lives。We're gonna check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.16,0:49:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们踩到了泳池上\NWe're in a swimming pool！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.33,0:50:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好冷啊\NWe're freezing！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.25,0:50:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拉你起来 过来\NPulling you up！Come here！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.33,0:50:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来\NCome on！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.70,0:50:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,爬到我的背上\NWhat should I do？Get on my back！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.70,0:50:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,“他们飞向梦幻岛”\N「…one step，they leapt into the sky toward Neverland.」
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.08,0:50:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么先生和女士要淹在水里\NWhy are man and lady drowning？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.54,0:50:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他们不是淹在水里 是飞在天上\NNo。They're not drowning。They're in the sky flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.37,0:50:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我上来了 好了\NOkay。I'm up。I'm up。Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.08,0:50:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,游到我这里来\NSwim。Swim to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.12,0:50:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拉你\NI got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.70,0:50:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拉你 过来\NPull you up。Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.79,0:50:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你上来了\NAnd you're out.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.08,0:50:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这是在干什么\NWhat are we doing？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.37,0:50:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是老师 你是数据…\NI am a teacher.\NYou're a data…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.12,0:50:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,迁移经理 经理\N…manager。Migration manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.91,0:51:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是老天在告诫我们\NMaybe the universe is trying to tell us something，you know？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.79,0:51:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们应该接受瓷娃娃弄丢了的事实\NI mean，maybe we should just cut our losses.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.25,0:51:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.12,0:51:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能放弃\NWe're not giving up.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.12,0:51:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须要CG 帕姆\NWe need a W，Pam.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.54,0:51:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功\NA win.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.50,0:51:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.70,0:51:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那本来就是我们的\NWe do deserve a W.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.91,0:51:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是好人 帕姆\NWe're good people，Pam.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.83,0:51:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,就因为那个英国臭小子\NAnd we're gonna lose our home because Harry stinkin' Potter
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.75,0:51:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,到我们家偷走了我们的救星 所以我们就要失去房子\Ncomes into our house and steals the only thing that can fix our problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.54,0:51:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 没有这种道理\NNo。That's an injustice.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.87,0:51:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 那不公平\NYeah。That's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.87,0:51:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们现在就放弃 那我们算什么\NAndAnd who are we if we give up now？I mean，what do we say to our kids？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.50,0:51:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要怎么跟孩子们说
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.08,0:51:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,“对不起 我们毁了你们的生活”\N「Oh，sorry we flushed your life down the toilet，
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.00,0:51:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,“但生活不断地用爱偷东西的小孩”\Nbut life kept smacking us down with klepto kids
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.00,0:51:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,“说德语的奶奶和愚蠢的云来击垮我们”\Nand German grandmothers and the stupid cloud.「
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.87,0:52:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恨你 云\NI hate you，cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.62,0:52:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们受够了\NEnough is enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.66,0:52:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的希望 我们家的希望都在那房子里 我们要拿回我们的希望\NOur W，our family's W，is in that house，and we're gonna get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.41,0:52:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就去\NRight now.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.79,0:52:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在可能不太合适\NWell，I don't know about right now。Becau
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.66,0:52:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们随时都会到家\NI mean，they could come home at any second.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.45,0:52:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且 我的裤子开始冻硬了\NAlso，my pants are starting to freeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.66,0:52:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的也是\NOh，mine too.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.75,0:52:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的腿已经完全没知觉了\NLike，I don't feel that.\NAt all.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.25,0:52:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就晚点再来\NSo let's come back later，you know？Like after dinner，after bbedtime even.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.91,0:52:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如吃晚饭后 甚至是等到入睡时间后
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.33,0:52:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者午夜 好吗 等老太太睡了再来\NMidnight，you know？Like after after the old lady's gone to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.79,0:52:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果那个孩子醒了怎么办\NYeah，but what if the kid wakes up？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.54,0:52:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们总是\NYou know，kids are always running down
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.16,0:52:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,要熬到深夜 看圣诞老人是不是来了\Nin the middle of the night to see if Santa came.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.62,0:52:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我假扮成圣诞老人怎么样\NWhat if I dress as Santa？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.25,0:52:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会觉得我是来送礼物的圣诞老人\NHe'll think I'm just Saint Nick.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.70,0:52:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我这个圣诞老人\NBut this Santa's gonna be leaving
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.25,0:52:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,会把那个价值二十万美元的丑娃娃 装到袋子里带走\Nwith that $200，000 ugly little boy in his sack.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.29,0:52:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样我们就成功了\NAnd that's how we win.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.33,0:52:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 那就午夜再来 圣诞老人先生\NOkay。Midnight it is，Mr。Claus.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.20,0:53:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,X消灭者ZL3 水枪
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.37,0:53:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好战斗了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.87,0:53:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不要被抓到某个老太太家\NI'm not spending my best years in some old lady's bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.66,0:53:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,小精灵 搜索厉害的陷阱\NHomebot，search good booby traps.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.87,0:53:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 本系统的家长限制系统 限制搜索词汇“遗骸”\NI'm sorry，the parental controls of this system restrict the term 「booby.」
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.08,0:53:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了\NNever mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.87,0:53:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢你的裙子 奥利 那是什么\NI love this dress。Ollie，Ollie，what is that？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.75,0:53:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你从教堂里拿的吗\NHey，did you take that from the church？Oh？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.87,0:53:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么…\NWhat
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.70,0:53:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 爸爸 你们去哪里了\NMom，Dad，where were you？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.91,0:53:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事了\NAnd whawhat happened？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.54,0:53:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,有辆车经过一个水坑 把我们都溅湿了\NA car drove through a puddle and splashed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.12,0:53:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,很讨厌 想象一下\NWhat is。Yuck。Imagine that.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.08,0:53:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得准备晚餐了 对吗\NWell，we should get dinner ready，huh？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.95,0:53:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.08,0:53:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,泛日本航空
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.50,0:53:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,10小时11分后抵达 东京成田机场 芝加哥奥尔黑国际机场
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.95,0:54:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我看你的屏幕了吗\NSorry。Am I looking at your screen？\NYes。Oh，okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.45,0:54:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.70,0:54:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看的时候没意识到\NYes。I didn't even realize I'm doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.70,0:54:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,很正常 是啊\NClassic。Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.20,0:54:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又看了 我又看了吗\NSorry，you're doing it again。I'm still doing it？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.16,0:54:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我就是控制不住\NYes。I justI just can't help it，you know？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.41,0:54:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的屏幕 那是你的\NThis is my screen，and that's your screen，so…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.70,0:54:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我知道怎么操作 好的\NNo，I know that。I know how screens work。Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.25,0:54:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,屏幕里其实有电视节目和电影 你懂吧\NYou know they got TV and films on there？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.62,0:54:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂 我非常懂 我只是急着想回家\NYep，yep，fully aware。I'm just，um，eager to get home.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.20,0:54:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这就像盯着一个烧水壶 你盯它水也不能加快烧开\NIt's like watching a watched pot，though。It's not gonna boil.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.70,0:54:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,总会烧开的\NYeah，well，it might one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.95,0:54:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.25,0:54:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我睡一会儿 谢谢\NI'll just get some sleep。Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.75,0:54:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要盖我的毯子吗 不要\NWould you like some of my blanket？Okay。No.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.87,0:54:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,10小时09分钟后抵达
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.75,0:55:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 很抱歉 我接受你的道歉了\NSorry。I'm sorry。Apology accepted.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.33,0:55:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,今年梅本来想在夏威夷过圣诞节的\NSo，Mei wanted to spend Christmas in Hawaii this year，
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.08,0:55:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我让她打消这个心思 来这里过节\Nbut I told her，we just gotta suck it up and come here
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.37,0:55:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我知道你们会喜欢的\Nbecause I knew you guys would appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.33,0:55:17.33,Title,0,0,0,0,,《牛津德语迷你字典》
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.70,0:55:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,作战计划
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.79,0:55:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,可乐 飞镖球
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.16,0:55:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,点火液
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.37,0:55:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可以当模特 他只有…\NHe could be a model，and he's only
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.54,0:55:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你几岁了 四岁\NHow old are you？Four，right？Like a runway model？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.41,0:55:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如走秀模特吗
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.70,0:55:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么模特都行 他们说他这个年纪 能有这种身材非常了不得\NAny kind of model。They say he has an incredible body for a boy his age.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.83,0:56:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,撒旦屁屁 核武器级辣酱
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.16,0:56:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞时光 充满欢乐
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.95,0:56:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但活在恐惧中的孩子却没有欢乐
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.50,0:56:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题不在于不幸的男孩和女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.62,0:56:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,得不到礼物和玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.33,0:56:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,黄油
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.58,0:56:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,在充满饥饿和战争的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.29,0:56:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都需要圣诞老人的安慰
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.16,0:57:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着 给孩子的 克里斯\NHere you go。Just for the kids。Chris.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.12,0:57:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,手表\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.00,0:57:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.16,0:57:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还不是我们给你们买的最贵的礼物哦\NThat's not the most expensive thing we bought you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.08,0:57:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能收 谢谢\NWe can't keep those。Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.33,0:57:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼妥思薄荷糖
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.25,0:57:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,看那两个温暖的小精灵 已经躺下了\NOh，look at those snuggly，little elves all ready for bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.12,0:57:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有半个小时就到圣诞节了 明天早上见\NOnly a halfhour left till Christmas。See you in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.37,0:58:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,子弹上膛 准备战斗\NLocked and loaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.04,0:58:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我有个计划\NOkay，we have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.37,0:58:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果按计划行事 我们就能神不知鬼不觉地完成任务\NIf we stick to it，we'll be back before anyone will even notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.70,0:58:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 慢点\NHoney，slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.62,0:58:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 慢点\NBabe，slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.91,0:58:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在减速了 但路太滑了\NI'm trying。It's so icy.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.33,0:58:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,踩刹车呀\NPut on the brakes！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.54,0:58:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,朝滑的方向打方向盘 不对\NSteer into the slide。No.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.87,0:58:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,遇到打滑时 是超打滑的方向打方向盘\NYou pump into a slide，and you steer into a skid.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.33,0:58:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底哪个是对的 我不知道\NWhich one is this？I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.20,0:58:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶\NYes.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.00,0:58:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 好了 逃过一劫\NOkay。Okay。It's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.45,0:58:59.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,本来结果会更严重的\NCould've been worse。Could've Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.29,0:59:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 忘掉这次的不顺利 打起精神\NOkay。Let's shake that off and focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.95,0:59:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来了\NWe are doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.20,0:59:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来了\NWe are doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.91,0:59:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们速战速决…\NWe'll be in and out before you
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.83,0:59:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来是没法顺利了\NThis is not going well.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.58,0:59:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好像摔坏尾椎了\NI think I shattered my coccyx.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.75,0:59:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心点 杰夫 这里很滑\NBe careful，Jeff。It's slippery.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.79,0:59:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 谢谢“提醒”了\NOh，really？Thanks for letting me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.70,0:59:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好像找到诀窍了\NI think I've worked out a good method.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.70,0:59:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么样\NHow are you doing？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.79,0:59:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 我在慢慢过去 我能行的\NGood。I'm getting there.\NI'm gonna make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.45,0:59:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我来了\NAll right。I'm doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.00,0:59:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟着你 亲爱的 再走一步就成功了\NI'm right behind you，babe。One more step and I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.62,1:00:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命 好的 我稳住你了\NSave me！Okay。I got you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.41,1:00:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是动态感应器\NThe motion sensor.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.04,1:00:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,躲起来 为什么灯光这么亮\NHide。Why is it so bright？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.95,1:00:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么这么暗\NWhy is it so dark？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.41,1:00:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来这里 亲爱的\NCome over here，honey。Come over here.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.20,1:00:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 快\NOkay。Quick，quick.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.33,1:00:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好耶\NYes！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.29,1:00:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么亮的灯得有多少流明啊\NWhat's the lumen count on that thing？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.66,1:00:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\NOh，man.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.08,1:00:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 如果他们醒了怎么办\NHey，what if they're awake？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.08,1:00:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里等着\NWait here.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.12,1:00:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是被缠上了\NNow it's retangling.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.58,1:00:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,转另一个方向 转 面向我\NGo the other way。Now turn。Face.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.16,1:00:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,缠得更紧了 转身\NIt's getting more wrapped up。Rotate.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.16,1:01:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没帮上忙 我有在帮\NYou're not helping。Yes，I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.83,1:01:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我弄好了 好\NOkay。Yeah，I did it。Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.29,1:01:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绕到后面去\NI'm going round back.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.20,1:01:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的圣诞老人
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.29,1:01:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,“亲爱的圣诞老人 我努力等你了 但我太困了 你可以直接进来”\N「Dear Santa。I tried waiting up for you，but I'm too sleepy.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.87,1:01:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你留了灯 你的头号粉丝 麦克斯\NCome on in！「
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.25,1:01:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,牛奶是辣的\NMilk hot！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.54,1:01:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么牛奶是辣的\NWhy milk hot？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.41,1:01:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,健怡 可乐
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.29,1:02:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始轰炸\NBombs away.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.00,1:02:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,停 停\NStop！Stop！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.12,1:02:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来妈妈说得没错 汽水不是好东西\NYou know，I guess my mum was right。Soda is bad for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.25,1:02:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我们只是想要回娃娃⋯\NWait！We just want our doll
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.70,1:02:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,停 我们可以好好谈\NStop！We can talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.29,1:02:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会有这么多汽水\NHow the heck do you have so much soda？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.29,1:02:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸妈批发的 价格更便宜\NMy parents buy in bulk。It's more cost effective.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.16,1:02:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,别想抓价值二十万的丑小孩\NAnd forget about taking this $200，000 ugly boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.91,1:02:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是来伤害你的\NWe're not here to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.37,1:03:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你冷静一些 我们好好谈\NPlease，just calm down，and we can talk about this rationally.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.54,1:03:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要再扔汽水了 好吗\NSo easy on the soda，okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.12,1:03:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\NOuch！Ouch！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.41,1:03:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,警报\NAlarm！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.70,1:03:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞老人 是你吗\NSanta？Is that you？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.08,1:04:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,嚯嚯嚯 你好吗 孩子\NHo！Ho！Ho！How are you，little boy？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.62,1:04:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,桔色的花色球 中袋\NOrange stripe，center pocket.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.66,1:04:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\NNo！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.00,1:04:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来好疼哦\NOoh！That did not sound right.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.79,1:04:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好热又好冷哦\NSo hot and so cold at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.45,1:04:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰夫\NJeff？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.79,1:04:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰夫\NJeff！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.54,1:04:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在哪里\NWhere am I？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.62,1:05:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 这里是哪儿 我害怕\NWhat？This。I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.45,1:05:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\NWhat is this？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.41,1:05:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 我没事 手脚都还在\NOkay。I'm okay。I have all my parts.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.70,1:05:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是死了吗 我这是死了吗\NAm I dead？Is this dead？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.12,1:05:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我站得太高了 太高了\NThat's too high！I'm too high.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.20,1:05:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢这样\NI don't like
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.70,1:05:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把我丢到了哪里\NWhere have you taken me？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.16,1:05:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以的 麦肯齐\NYou can do this，McKenzie.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.58,1:05:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只需要跨过去 就只跳一小步\NOkay，you just gotta make it across.\NJust one small jump.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.62,1:05:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二 三\NOne，two，three！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.50,1:05:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰夫\NJeff？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.83,1:05:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰夫\NJeff？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.87,1:05:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰夫\NJeff！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.12,1:06:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,有东西顶着门\NThere's something blocking the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.16,1:06:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的\NOh，honey.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.79,1:06:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他攻击我 帕姆\NHe's hurting me，Pam.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.50,1:06:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是 亲爱的\NMe too，baby。Me too.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.00,1:06:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个英国小混蛋想要烧我\NLittle，limey monster tried to set me on fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.37,1:06:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为什么要这么做 帕姆\NWhy's he doing this to us，Pam？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.12,1:06:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说我们别想拿到二十万美元\NHe just told me our 200 grand is getting away.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.54,1:06:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,娃娃在他手上 他知道娃娃的价值\NHe has our doll，and he knows what it's worth.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.29,1:06:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得拿回来\NWe have to get it back.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.04,1:07:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃菲尔铁塔 你也来伤我？\NThe Eiffel Tower？Really？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.58,1:07:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不准说我不对 我这是为了我们家\NDon't you dare judge me。I'm doing this for my family.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.91,1:07:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,8小时11分后抵达
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.95,1:07:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,打探到什么了吗\NYou learned anything？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.58,1:07:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打探到他有很多乐高积木\NJust that this kid owns a lot of Legos.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.37,1:07:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们进来了\NWe are coming in…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.08,1:07:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我忘记怎么用德语说“友好”了\NI forgot the word for peace.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.70,1:07:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,查一下 好的 看看\NYeah，look it up。Okay，let's see.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.50,1:07:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,“友爱” 不对 “友善” “友谊”\N「Pancake.」 No。「Potato.」 「Paralysis.」
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.75,1:08:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这儿\NUp here。Oh，hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.37,1:08:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 听着 我们只是想跟你谈谈\NOkay。SoSo listen。We just wanna talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.16,1:08:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能不能停下来跟我们谈谈\NWould you just stop and talk to us？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.54,1:08:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了\NPlease！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.08,1:08:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们友好地进来了\NWe are coming in Frieden.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.37,1:08:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道“友好”怎么说了\NFrieden is peace.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.83,1:08:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,上来抓我啊\NCome on up and get me！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.00,1:08:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\NOuch.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.87,1:08:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在楼梯上涂了黄油\NHe put butter on the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.79,1:08:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是面粉 又是牛奶 又是黄油的\NFlour，milk and butter.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.75,1:08:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想把我们做成饼干\NHe's turning me into a cookie.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.20,1:08:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,要做饼干的话还需要糖\NWell，you need sugar for a cookie.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.41,1:08:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,糖
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.25,1:08:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁家养了这么个小浑蛋\NWho raised this little monster？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.87,1:08:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还是回家吧\NI think we should go back home.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.08,1:08:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能退缩\NThere is no going back.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.75,1:08:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经这样了\NThis is who we are now.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.33,1:08:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们选择的人生\NThis is the life we've chosen.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.66,1:09:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经走上了坏的道路\NWe've gone to the other side.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.16,1:09:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们找不到我哦\NYou'll never find me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.62,1:09:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个英国小鬼把我变成了针插\NHarry Potter turned me into a pincushion.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.50,1:09:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 亲爱的 我这就来\NGood job，honey。I'll be right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.20,1:09:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我没说\NOr not.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.54,1:10:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊\NWell，hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.70,1:10:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着\NCatch.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.00,1:10:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会吧 竟然用这么软的瑜伽球来砸我\NOh，no。You hit me with the incredibly soft yoga ball.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.62,1:10:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住他 杰夫\NGo get him，Jeff.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.87,1:10:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要放弃了吗 还是想再多来点\NGiven up yet？Or are you thirsty for more？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.54,1:10:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,八号球 面部\NEight ball。Your face.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.20,1:11:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在跑不掉了 小鬼\NThere's nowhere to run now，little man.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.95,1:11:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就等着瞧\NWe'll see about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.33,1:11:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜拜\NSee ya.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.62,1:11:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕姆 他从阳台跳下去了\NPam，he jumped off the balcony！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.66,1:11:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\NGood.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.08,1:11:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那件夹克\NThe jacket.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.54,1:11:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 原来有梯子\NOh，no。A ladder.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.29,1:11:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真以为我是傻子吗\NYou really think I'm that stupid？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.12,1:11:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊 我就是这么以为的\NYes。Yes，I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.91,1:11:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓷娃娃\NDolly？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.45,1:11:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\NWhat？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.50,1:12:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了 你完了 小鬼\NThat's it。Time's up，little guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.08,1:12:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\NNo！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.33,1:12:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了\NThat's far enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.33,1:12:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊\NWell，hello there.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.37,1:12:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会开枪的哦\NI'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.45,1:12:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 不要再射台球了\NPlease，please，please no more pool balls.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.50,1:12:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,把枪放下\NDrop the gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.41,1:12:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能\NNot a chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.29,1:13:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不是吓唬你们\NI'm not playing around，lady.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.91,1:13:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真不是吓唬人 他今晚朝我射了好几个台球\NHe's not。He He shot me with several pool balls tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.79,1:13:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了\NEnough！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.08,1:13:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,该了结了\NThis stops here.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.20,1:13:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你惹错了人\NYou picked the wrong mom to mess with.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.20,1:13:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 你还好吗\NHoney，are you okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.83,1:13:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 不要乐高积木和点火了\NPlease，no more Legos or fire
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.00,1:13:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不要图钉了 我们只想谈谈\Nor freaking thumbtacks。We just wanna talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.29,1:13:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 我听到你们的计划了\NYeah，right。I heard your plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.87,1:13:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想要绑架我这个“丑小孩”\NYou wanna kidnap 「the ugly boy」
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.20,1:13:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后叫价二十万 把我卖给某个老太太\Nand sell me to some old lady for 200 large.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.29,1:13:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\NWhat？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.91,1:13:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\NWhat？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.00,1:13:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不丑 我妈妈说我是有个性\NAnd I'm not ugly。My mum says I've got character.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.87,1:13:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为…\NYou thought
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.45,1:13:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你才制造了这个死亡迷宫吗\NIs that why you made this death maze？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.37,1:13:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 我们只想要回我们的瓷娃娃\NKid，we just want our doll back.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.41,1:14:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么瓷娃娃\NWhat doll？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.62,1:14:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从我们家偷的那个脸装错的丑娃娃\NThe one you stole from our house。The boy with the bad face。The ugly boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.41,1:14:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个吗 我没偷呀\NThat？I didn't steal that.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.62,1:14:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我十岁了 我要娃娃做什么\NI'm ten years old。Why on earth would I want a doll？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.54,1:14:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 太糟糕了\NOh，no。This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.29,1:14:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们做了糟糕的事情\NWe did a bad thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.62,1:14:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们做了超级糟糕的事情\NOne of the worst bads we could've done.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.04,1:14:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们得叫醒你的奶奶\NI think we need to wake up your grandma.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.29,1:14:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要打电话到英国叫我奶奶吗\NYou wanna call my grandma in England？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.87,1:14:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是住在这里的奶奶\NNo。The grandma who's staying here.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.12,1:14:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,从德国来的那个\NFrom Germany.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.54,1:14:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我奶奶没跟我住在一起呀\NMy grandma's not staying with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.29,1:14:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 那个人是谁\NWell，then who is？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.79,1:14:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,没别人 就我自己\NNo one。It's just me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.54,1:15:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\NWhat？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.75,1:15:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你的爸妈呢\NWait，where are your parents？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.45,1:15:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,在东京\NTokyo.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.37,1:15:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 真抱歉\NOh。Sweetie，I am so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.79,1:15:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们知道你是独自在家\NIf we had known you were staying here by yourself，
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.79,1:15:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们肯定换一个完全不同的方式了\Nwe would've handled things a lot differently.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.62,1:15:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一次也不会闯入你们家\NWe wouldn't have broken into your home even once.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.45,1:15:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是天大的误会\NThis was just a huge misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.58,1:15:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把重型机枪放下来好不好\NNow，why don't you just put that heavy gun down？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.62,1:15:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 过来\NOh，sweetie，come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.12,1:15:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在安全了\NYou're safe now.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.70,1:15:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会照顾你的 好吗\NWe'll take care of you，okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.08,1:15:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.04,1:15:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这看起来像恶作剧\NOkay，I know what it looks like…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.45,1:16:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这真的是意外\NBut that was genuinely an accident.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.87,1:16:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望如此\NWell，I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.50,1:16:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为 不\NBecauseNo.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.87,1:16:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得休息一下 我得坐下来\NI gotta go take aI'm gonna go sit down.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.83,1:16:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我们给你爸妈打电话 跟他们报平安\NOkay。Let's call your parents and let them know that you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.62,1:16:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他们回来之前你可以和我们在一起\NYou can stay with us till they get back.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.00,1:16:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一定会修理我的\NI'm gonna be in so much trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.04,1:16:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 亲爱的\NNo，honey.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.37,1:16:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈妈见到你一定会很开心的 我保证\NYour mom is just gonna be happy to see you。I promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.16,1:16:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,一开始开心\NAt first.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.29,1:16:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但接着你要完蛋了\NButBut then you'll be in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.58,1:16:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,彻底完蛋 我可以想象\NPretty bad，I wouldI would imagine.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.75,1:16:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都要跟他们好好解释\NI think we're all gonna have quite a bit of explaining to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.04,1:16:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们闯进这孩子的家 因为你们以为他偷了瓷娃娃\NOkay，so，you go to this kid's house，because you think he stole the doll…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.62,1:16:46.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在路上撞上了树 所以…\N…and on the way there，you hit a tree，\Nwhich is why…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.87,1:16:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.95,1:16:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你们到他家的时候 他独自在家吗\NAnd then when you get to this kid's house，he's home alone？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.00,1:16:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 差不多就是这样\NYes。Pretty much，yeah。Yes。Mmhmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.91,1:16:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\NWow.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.33,1:16:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈妈呢 你和她说了吗\NHow about your mom？Have you talked to her？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.33,1:16:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,说了 她降落时我们给她打了电话\NYeah，we called her when she landed.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.70,1:17:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,她高兴得哭了 没想到你们能让她不发火\NShe cried happy tears。I didn't even know you could do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.12,1:17:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我们要搬家了吗\NSo，are we moving？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.29,1:17:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 孩子们…\NI'm sorry，guys…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.08,1:17:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人给我们报了价\NBut we got an offer on the house，
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.91,1:17:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没办法 只能接受\Nand we can't afford not to take it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.70,1:17:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但没关系\NBut it's okay，
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.12,1:17:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为让这房子变得特别的是我们一家人\Nbecause what makes this house so special to us is us.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.12,1:17:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吗\NRight？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.16,1:17:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈妈说得很对\NYour mum speaks a lot of sense.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.16,1:17:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有爸爸妈妈的家 根本没有家的感觉\NWithout my mum and dad，my house really didn't feel like home.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.33,1:17:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 会不会是开放日那天 来看房的人拿了娃娃\NOh，babe，what if one of those open house poacher people took the doll？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.33,1:17:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 杰夫 你听说过这种事吗\NMmm，yes。Jeff，have you heard about this？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.20,1:17:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那种人会进你的家 把值钱的东西都偷走 很过分\NThey just come into your house and take all of your valuables。It's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.45,1:17:57.79,Title,0,0,0,0,,知名法律主持在《新闻60分》里做过报道\NGreta Van Susteren did a thing about it on 60 Minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.87,1:17:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,整集报道 对 整集报道\NFull hour。Yeah。Full hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.66,1:18:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这谁知道呢 那个知名主持就知道\NWho knows？Greta Van Susteren knows.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.70,1:18:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在的情况是娃娃不见了 我们得…\NBut it's gone now，and，you know，we need to
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.91,1:18:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥利？\NOllie？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.08,1:18:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,娃娃\NDoll.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.83,1:18:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥利 宝贝 你别动\NOllie，angel，do not move.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.20,1:19:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真厉害\NThat was incredible.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.37,1:19:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\NAre you okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.79,1:19:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 我们都很好\NYeah。Yeah，I think we both are.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.20,1:19:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁能想到奥利是大救星呢 对吧\NHey，who would've thought Ollie was gonna save the day，right？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.37,1:19:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶 宝贝 干得好 干得好 小鬼\NYay，baby。Good job，my love。Good job，buddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.75,1:19:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\NMum！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.66,1:19:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克斯\NMax。Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.58,1:19:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把你丢下了 对不起 宝贝\NOh。I'm so sorry we left you，darling.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.58,1:20:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看你\NLet me look at you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.33,1:20:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有个好儿子\NYou've got a great kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.58,1:20:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 没错\NYeah。Yeah，I really do.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.79,1:20:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很有“创意”\NHe's very creative.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.00,1:20:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,“创意” 对 他非常有“创意”\NCreative。Yes。He's so creative.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.91,1:20:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 很高兴…\NThank you。That's nice to，um
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.37,1:20:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来那个小车祸还挺严重的\NWow，that really was some fender bender.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.75,1:20:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看过那棵被撞的树就知道了\NYou should see the tree.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.29,1:20:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要坐一坐吗\NOh。DoDo you wanna stay？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.37,1:20:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有很多蛋酒\NBecause we have a lot of eggnog.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.95,1:20:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的蛋酒多得都不知道该怎么办了\NThey got more nog than they know what to do with.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.04,1:20:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 但不用了\NOh。Uh，uh，thank you，but，uh，no.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.45,1:20:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在只想带这小家伙回家\NI just wanna get this guy home now.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.08,1:20:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来没这么期待着想回家\NNever been so excited to see my house.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.87,1:20:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个…\NActually
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.33,1:20:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 家\NYes！Home。Mmmmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.58,1:20:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,家是心灵的归宿\NHome is where the heart is.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.16,1:20:58.50,Title,0,0,0,0,,引自《阿拉巴马 甜蜜的家》\N「Sweet Home Alabama.」
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.54,1:21:01.45,Title,0,0,0,0,,荷马的《奥赛德》也这么说\NHomer's Odyssey.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.54,1:21:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,故事的结局是什么 回家\NWhere do they wind up at the end？Home.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.20,1:21:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,剧透警告\NSpoiler alert.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.29,1:21:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太小了 可能没读过 他们最后回家了\NYou're probably too young to have read it，but they end up at home.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.83,1:21:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 太温馨了\NYeah，that's lovely.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.20,1:21:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有比家更好的地方了 谢谢 谢谢\NThere is no place like home。Thank you。Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.20,1:21:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 小家伙\NCome on，you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.16,1:21:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐 麦克斯\NMerry Christmas，Max.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.62,1:21:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,保重\NBe good.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.00,1:21:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是\NYou too.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.00,1:21:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想再抱你一下\NOoh。I need another hug.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.75,1:21:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好想你\NI missed you so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.25,1:21:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望家里没被你弄乱\NHey，I hope the house isn't a mess.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.08,1:21:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\NWow.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.29,1:21:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\NWow.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.41,1:21:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,她回家一定很高兴\NShe must be so happy to finally be home。Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.16,1:21:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.45,1:21:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为家意味着家人 对吗\NBecause I guess home is just another word for family，right？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.20,1:21:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是不是表示我们可以留在这里了\NSo，does that mean we get to stay here？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.33,1:21:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 宝贝 没错 太好了\NYeah，sweetie。It does。Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.87,1:22:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.20,1:22:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈的肋骨疼\NMommy's ribs。Mommy's ribs are sore.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.95,1:22:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不穷了 真开心\NSo glad they're not poor anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.54,1:22:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得很不自在 真尴尬\NIt made me so uncomfortable。It was so awkward.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.45,1:22:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我们来开礼物吧\NHey，what do you say we open some presents？\NYes！Yes！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.66,1:22:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.41,1:22:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,真想不到 天啊\NCan I open the big one？Oh，my gosh！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.58,1:22:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐 圣诞快乐\NMerry Christmas。Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.58,1:22:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要先开 我先开\NI call opening first。Me first.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.16,1:22:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 孩子们 一次开一个\NOkay，guys。One at a time.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.29,1:22:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 谢谢爸爸 谢谢\NThank you，Dad。Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.04,1:22:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢\NI love it.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.41,1:22:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道我有多想你\NYou wouldn't believe how much I missed you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.54,1:22:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这将是我们两个人的圣诞节\NIt's just gonna be two of us for Christmas，hey？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.00,1:22:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定很开心的 对吧\NThat'll be nice，won't it？Mmhmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.95,1:22:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 多美好的一天啊\NOh，dear。What a day.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.45,1:22:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,甜蜜的家\NHome sweet home.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.62,1:22:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以跟你好好解释\NThere's a very reasonable explanation.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.33,1:22:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,一年以后
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.50,1:23:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他像一个小政客\NI think he looks like a little politician.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.75,1:23:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 政客？ 他看起来像个政客\NMum，please。He looks like a politician.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.87,1:23:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是毛衣背心的缘故 他确实像个政客\NPart of it's the sweater vest。He does look like a politician.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.33,1:23:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢 真的很喜欢 妈妈\NI like it。I actually like it。Mum.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.95,1:23:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不知道… 好了 大伙儿 可以开动了\NI don't even know anything about… Okay，everybody，time to eat.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.08,1:23:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这道菜看起来太棒了\NOh，this looks incredible.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.58,1:23:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感谢 你们的房子太美了\NThank you so much，and the house looks so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.41,1:23:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用谢我\NOh，don't thank me.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.70,1:23:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢那个怪娃娃吧\NThank that creepy doll.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.91,1:23:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们卖了它来支付各种费用 比如抵押贷款 欧洲旅行费…\NSelling that paid for everything。Our mortgage，our trip to Europe…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.12,1:23:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你的新吊灯\NAnd your new chandelier.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.08,1:23:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 还有干板墙\NThank you。And don't forget the drywall.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.41,1:23:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 是啊\NOh，yeah。Well
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.50,1:23:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,难怪我一直觉得这房子重新装修过了\NI always thought the house could've done with a little remodeling anyway。So…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.58,1:23:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续保持这些设置 特里 好的 祝好 好了 抱歉\NKeep it on those settings，Terry。All right。Take it easy。All right。Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.29,1:23:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 大伙儿 是工作的事 很抱歉\NSorry，everybody。That was work。Apologies.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.37,1:23:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,在圣诞节谈工作？\NOn Christmas Day？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.66,1:23:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰夫被提升成为了地区经理\NJeff has been promoted to District Manager.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.41,1:23:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,云是不过圣诞节的 迈克\NThere's no Christmas for the cloud，Mike.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.79,1:23:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,云永远不休息\NThe cloud never sleeps.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.33,1:23:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我全天候提供云管理服务 包括…\NAnd I provide 247 cloud management services。And that includes
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.95,1:23:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\NDad.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.66,1:23:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们干杯吧\NLet's make a toast.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.00,1:24:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以喝一罐那个吗\NYes。Oh，um，can I get one of those？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.91,1:24:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们的含糖量很高\NYou know，they're quite sugary.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.12,1:24:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们得让他喝一罐汽水\NI think we should let him have the soda.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.87,1:24:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得上一次的事吗\NRemember what happened last time？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.91,1:24:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 小家伙 谢谢\NThere you go，buddy。Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.91,1:24:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,干杯\NCheers.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.58,1:24:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,敬新朋友\NTo new friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.95,1:24:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,和家人\NAnd family。Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.08,1:24:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝我不会得永久性的神经损伤\NAnd me having no permanent neurological damage.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.58,1:24:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\NYeah，that's good.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.50,1:24:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要敬麦克斯 谢谢你让我们相识\NAnd here's to Max for bringing us all together.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.58,1:24:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家圣诞快乐\NMerry Christmas，everybody.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.83,1:24:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐 圣诞快乐 干杯\NMerry Christmas！Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.70,1:24:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐 宝贝 圣诞快乐 干杯 宝贝\NMerry Christmas，darling。Merry Christmas。Cheers，darling.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.54,1:24:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家圣诞快乐\NMerry Christmas，everyone！
